Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bio readouts are all in the green。Looks like she's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there goes our salvage，guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How are we today？- Ohh。Terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，better than yesterday，at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where am I？- You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're at Gateway Station。Been here a couple of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were pretty groggy at first，but now you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，looks like you've got a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jonesy。Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you，you stupid cat？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you？Where have you been？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guess you two have met，huh？I'm Burke。Carter Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I work for the company，but don't let that fool you。I'm really an okay guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you're feeling a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,They tell me that all the weakness and disorientation should pass soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's just natural side effects of such an unusually long hypersleep，or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long was I out there？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inhalation Therapy，report to-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Has no one discussed this with you yet？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。But，I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't… recognize this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I know。Uh-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。It's just that，uh，this might be a shock to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's long - How long？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 57 years。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the thing。You were out there for 57 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened was you had drifted right through the core systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's really just blind luck…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,that a deep-salvage team found you when they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's one in a thousand，really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you're damn lucky to be alive，kiddo。You could be floating out there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You-You okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh-h-h！Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nurse！Please！- God！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone get in here now！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hold！- Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill me！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bad dreams again？You want something to help you sleep？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've slept enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.73,0:08:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr Hirsch，334。Dr。Hirsch，334.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。Sorry I'm late。I've been running behind all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there any word about my daughter？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… I really think we should worry about the hearing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,'Cause we don't have a lot of time，okay？I read your deposition，and it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you just stick to that，I think we'll be fine。The thing to remember is，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,there're gonna be a lot of heavyweights in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got feds and Interstellar Commerce Commission，
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Colonial Administration，insurance company guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you have any news about my daughter？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，we did come up with some information。Why don't we sit down？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was hoping to wait until after the inquest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Amanda Ripley-McClaren」，married name，I guess…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Age 66.」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that was at the time of her death，
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,which was two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm real sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,She was cremated and interred at Westlake Repository，Little Chute，Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No children。I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promised her… that I'd be home for her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her 11th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'djust like to go，uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,back to this point about the override destruct order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:11:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is it in the file？- I don't understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have been here for three and a half hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，how many different ways do you want me to tell the same story？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at it from our perspective，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you freely admit to detonating the engines of，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,and thereby destroying，an M-class starsreighter，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,a rather expensive piece of hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forty-two million in adjusted dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's minus payload，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,The lifeboat's flight recorder corroborates some elements of your account，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,in that，for reasons unknown，the Nostromo set down on LV-426，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,an unsurveyed planet at that time，that it resumed its course…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,and was subsequently set for self-destruct by you for reasons unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not for reasons unknown。I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We set down there on company orders to get this thing，which destroyed my crew…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,and your expensive ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The analysis team，which went over the lifeboat centimeter by centimeter，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,found no physical evidence of the creature you describe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good！That's because I blew it out of the goddamn air lock，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are there any species like this hostile organism on LV-426？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。It's a rock。No indigenous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did I.Q.'s just drop sharply while I was away？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ma'am，I already said it was not indigenous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a derelict spacecraft。It was an alien ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was not from there。Do you get it？We homed in on its beacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,And found something never recorded once…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,in over 300 surveyed worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「A creature that gestates inside a living human host.」 - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are your words。「And has concentrated acid for blood.」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:13:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。I can see where this is going，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I'm telling you that those things exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thank you，Officer Ripley。That will be all。- Please。You're not listening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kane，the crew member-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kane，who went into that ship，said he saw thousands of eggs there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thousands。- Thank you。That will be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn it，that's not all！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because if one of those things gets down here，then that will be all！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then all of this-this bullshit that you think is so important-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can just kiss all of that good-bye！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is the finding of this court of inquiry that…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warrant Officer E。Ripley，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,NOC14472，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,has acted with questionable judgment…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,and is unfit to hold an I.C.C。license as a commercial flight officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Said license is hereby suspended indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，no criminal charges will be filed against you at this time，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,and you are released on your own recognizance…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,for a six-month period ofpsychometric probation，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,to include monthly review by an I.C.C。psychiatric technician.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,These proceedings are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That could have been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look，I think the-Ripley？- Van Leuwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you just check out LV-426？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because I don't have to。There have been people there for over 20 years，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- and they never complained about any hostile organism。- What do you mean？What people？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Terraformers。Planet engineers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,They go in，set up these big atmosphere processors to make the air breathable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Takes decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what we call a 「Shake 'N Bake」 colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many are there？How many colonists？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know-60，maybe 70 families。Do you mind？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Families.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be down in maintenance，okay？Al！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Hey，Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Remember you sent some wildcatters…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,out to the middle of nowhere last week，out past the Ilium Range？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，what？- One of them's on the horn，a mom-and-pop survey team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says he's onto something。He wants to know if his claim will be honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't his claim be honored？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，because you sent them to that particular middle-of-nowhere on company orders，maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't know。- Christ！Some honch in a cushy office on Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,says，「Go look at a grid reference.」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,We look。They don't say why，and I don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't ask，because it takes two weeks to get an answer out here，and the answer is always-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Don't ask.」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what do I tell this guy？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell him as far as I'm concerned，if he finds something，it is his.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lydecker？- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You kids know you're not supposed to be on this level！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on！Get outta here！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do too。You go in places we can't fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So？That's why I'm the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knock it off！I catch either of you playing in the air ducts again，l'll tan your hides.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom，all the kids play-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。Annie，come and have a look at this，will ya？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Folks，we have scored big this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it，Dad？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's see if we can't get a closer look at this thing，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,maybe through that crack there on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we call in？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's wait till we know what to call it in as.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's about as close as we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should we take a look inside？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You two stay inside。I mean it。We'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay。- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy，they've been gone a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be okay，Newt。Dad knows what he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mayday，Mayday！This is Alpha Kilo Two Four Niner calling！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Alpha Kilo Two Four Niner！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alpha Kilo Two Four Niner calling！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hiya，Ripley。This is Lieutenant Gorman…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,of the Colonial Marine Corps-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，we have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've lost contact with the colony on LV-426.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You guys throw me at the wolves，and now you want me to go back out there？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget it。It's not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can I finish？- No。There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，you wouldn't be going in with the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.49,0:22:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,These Colonial Marines are very tough hombres.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.67,0:22:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're packing state-of-the-art firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing they can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lieutenant，am I right？- That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been trained to deal with situations like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you don't need me。I'm not a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but we don't know exactly what's going on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It mayjust be a downed transmitter，okay？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if it's not，I would like you there as an adviser，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,and that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your interest in all this？Why are you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corporation cofinanced that colony，
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,along with Colonial Administration.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're getting into a lot of terraforming now。「Building Better Worlds」-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.23,0:22:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，yeah。I saw the commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I don't have time for this。I've got to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，right。I heard you're working the cargo docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:23:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Running loaders and forklifts，that sort of thing？- Yeah。So？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.21,0:23:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。I think it's great that you're keeping busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know it's the only thing that you could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,What would you say if I told you I could get you reinstated…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,as a flight officer？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The company's already agreed to pick up your contract。- If I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.56,0:23:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，if you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.61,0:23:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。That's a second chance，kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.86,0:23:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think，personally，for you，it would be the best thing in the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.70,0:23:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,to get out there and face this thing，get back on the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spare me，Burke。I've had my psych evaluation this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I know。I've read it。You wake up every night。Your sheets are soaking with sweat-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.87,0:23:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said no，and I mean it！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，please leave。I am not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I am-I would not be any good to you if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:24:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Would you do me a favor？Just think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.15,0:24:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks for the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.26,0:25:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.26,0:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.10,0:25:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You okay？- Just tell me one thing，Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.73,0:25:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going out there to destroy them，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.10,0:25:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not to study，not to bring back，but to wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the plan。You have my word on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think that-
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.30,0:25:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you，you little shithead，
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.27,0:25:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.70,0:28:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,They ain't payin' us enough for this，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.62,0:28:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not enough to have to wake up to your face，Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.13,0:28:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is that a joke？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I wish it were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Hicks。Man，you look just like I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，sweethearts。What are you waiting for？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Breakfast in bed？Another glorious day in the corps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.69,0:28:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,A day in the Marine Corps is like a day on the farm…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.27,0:28:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,every meal's a banquet，every paycheck a fortune，every formation a parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I love the corps！- Christ！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.11,0:29:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，this floor is freezing！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.07,0:29:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you want me to do？Fetch your slippers for ya？- Gee，would you，sir？I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.54,0:29:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look into my eye。Fall in，people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.87,0:29:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hate this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.30,0:29:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowe，Wierzbowski。Come on。On your feet。We got some slack coming，right？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.05,0:29:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had three weeks on your back，Frost。What do you want？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.01,0:29:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm talking about breathing，not this frozen shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.47,0:29:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，Top。How 'bout it？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。First assembly's in 15，people。Shag it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，mira。Who's Snow White？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's supposed to be some kind of consultant.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.35,0:29:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Apparently，she saw an alien once.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.69,0:29:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoopee-fuckin'-do！Hey，I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,iQue bonita！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.19,0:29:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Vasquez。Have you ever been mistaken for a man？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.41,0:29:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Have you？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.53,0:30:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha，ha！Oh，Vasquez。You're just too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Top，what's the op？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.84,0:30:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a rescue mission。You'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.05,0:30:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's some juicy colonists' daughters we have to rescue from their virginity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.85,0:30:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dumb-ass colonists.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.61,0:30:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this crap supposed to be？- Vasquez.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corn bread，I think。It's good for you，boy。Eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.53,0:30:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，sure wouldn't mind getting some more of that Arcturian poontang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.62,0:30:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Remember that time？- Yeah。Except the one that you had was male.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.83,0:30:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter when it's Arcturian.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.54,0:30:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Bishop，man。Do the thing with the knife。- Oh，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.08,0:30:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，come on。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.63,0:30:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't want to see that，man。- Come on，man。All right。All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.30,0:30:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what are you doing，man？What are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.39,0:31:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。Quit messing around，Drake。- Hudson，shut up ！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bishop，hey，man。- Do it，Bishop！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.27,0:31:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey！Not me，man！Quit messing around！- Yeah，you！Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.94,0:31:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.95,0:31:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Knock it off，knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you go，short shit。Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.54,0:31:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That wasn't funny，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.44,0:31:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Lieutenant Gorman？Mr。Burke？- Yeah，thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like the new lieutenant's too good to eat with the rest of us grunts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy's definitely got a corncob up his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.90,0:31:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thought you never miss，Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.90,0:31:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never said anything about an android being on board。Why not？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.78,0:32:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It never-never occurred to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.91,0:32:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just common practice。We always have a synthetic on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.08,0:32:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,I prefer the term 「artificial person」 myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.62,0:32:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.59,0:32:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is there a problem？- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.34,0:32:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know why I didn't even-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.34,0:32:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley's last trip out，the syn-the artificial person malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.84,0:32:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Malfunctioned？- There were problems and a few deaths were involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.81,0:32:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm shocked。Was it an older model？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Hyperdyne Systems 120-A2.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.85,0:32:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,That explains it then。The A2s always were a bit twitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,That could never happen now with our behavioral inhibitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.32,0:32:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is impossible for me to harm，or by omission ofaction，allow to be harmed，a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sure you don't want some？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just stay away from me，Bishop。You got that straight？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.67,0:32:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Guess she don't like the corn bread，either.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.35,0:33:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Squad，ten-hut！Officer on deck！- As you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quickly，quickly。Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.48,0:33:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Listen up！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning，marines。l'm sorry we didn't have time to brief you people before we left Gateway-
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.74,0:33:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sir？- What is it，Hicks？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.28,0:33:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson，sir。He's Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.45,0:33:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the question？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.46,0:33:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is this gonna be a stand-up fight，sir，or another bug hunt？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.34,0:33:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,All we know is that there's still no contact with the colony…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.51,0:33:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,and that a xenomorph may be involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.47,0:33:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Excuse me，sir。A what？- A xenomorph.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.26,0:33:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a bug hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What exactly are we dealing with here？- Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.39,0:33:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,We set down on LV-426.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:34:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,One ofour crew members was brought back on board with something attached to his face，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.49,0:34:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,some kind of parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.07,0:34:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We tried to get it off。It wouldn't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.49,0:34:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Later，it seemed to come off by itselfand die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.49,0:34:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kane seemed fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We were all having dinner，and，um，
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.33,0:34:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,it must have laid something inside his throat，some sort of embryo.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.59,0:34:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He started-Um，he - Look，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.63,0:34:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only need to know one thing-where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.80,0:34:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yo，Vasquez。Kick ass。- Anytime，anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.64,0:34:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，right。Somebody said 「alien.」 She thought they said 「illegal alien」 and signed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.60,0:34:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuck you，man。- Anytime，anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.65,0:34:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you finished？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.45,0:34:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you're right。I really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.41,0:34:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，okay，right。Thank you，Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.54,0:34:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We also have Ripley's report on disk。I suggest you study it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.58,0:35:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because just one of those things managed to wipe out my entire crew in less than 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if the colonists have found that ship，then there's no telling…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.38,0:35:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,how many of them have been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.13,0:35:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you understand？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.31,0:35:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，we have it on disk，so you better look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.64,0:35:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any questions？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.39,0:35:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it，Private？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.86,0:35:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do I get out of this chickenshit outfit？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.94,0:35:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You secure that shit，Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.36,0:35:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.53,0:35:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.74,0:35:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want this thing to go smooth…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.95,0:35:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,and by the numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.58,0:35:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want D.C.S。and tactical database assimilation by 0830.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.13,0:35:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ordinance loading，weapons strip and drop-ship prep details…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.22,0:35:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- will have seven hours。- Oh，come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.68,0:35:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，move it，people！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.93,0:35:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，sweethearts。You heard the man，and you know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.72,0:35:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Assholes and elbows！Hudson，come here。Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.16,0:36:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care if you are short，Hudson。Get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.24,0:36:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Sarge。You'll get lip cancer smoking those.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.91,0:36:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corporal，I want this loading lock sealed。Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.17,0:36:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How many more you got，Spunkmeyer？- Last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.67,0:36:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.15,0:36:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.41,0:36:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you check number three？Let me see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.12,0:36:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hi。I feel like kind of a fifth wheel around here。Is there anything I can do？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.12,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Is there anything you can do？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.46,0:37:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I can drive that loader.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.79,0:37:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a Class 2 rating.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.55,0:37:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.18,0:37:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where you want it？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.18,0:38:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bay 12，please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.99,0:39:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，sweethearts。We're a team，and there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We come here，and we gonna conquer，and we gonna kick some.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.17,0:39:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that understood？That's what we gonna do，sweethearts。- Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.13,0:39:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are going to go and get some。Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，people！On the ready line！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.43,0:39:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you lean？Are you mean？- Yeah！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.30,0:39:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What are you？What are you？- Lean and mean！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson！Get on the ready line，marine！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.89,0:39:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get some today！Get on the ready line！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.94,0:39:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo！Move it out！Move it out，goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.94,0:39:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get hot！One，two，three！Get out，get out，get out！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.61,0:39:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move it out，move it out，move it out！Move it out，move it out，move it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.91,0:39:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Absolutely badasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.62,0:39:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's pack 'em in。Get in there！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.12,0:39:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！Move it！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.21,0:39:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，let's go！One，two，three，
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.96,0:39:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,four，five，six！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.39,0:39:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I want combat seating。You know your places.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.95,0:40:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get those weapons stowed。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.33,0:40:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Settle down，people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.75,0:40:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lock 'em in，Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready to get it on？You know it！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.42,0:40:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Bishop，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.17,0:40:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.13,0:40:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm ready，man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.97,0:40:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ready to get it on！Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.60,0:40:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by。Cross-locking now。Prelaunch autocycle engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.86,0:40:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Primary couplers released。Hit the internals.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.42,0:40:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shit，man。- Confirm cross-lock and drop stations secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.21,0:40:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Affirmative。All drop stations secured.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.01,0:41:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by。Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.18,0:41:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by to initiate release sequencer… on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.31,0:41:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Five，four，three，- We're on an express elevator to hell，going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.07,0:41:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,two，one，mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.84,0:41:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Switch to D.C.S。ranging。- 240，nominal to profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.30,0:41:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in the pipe，five by five.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.73,0:41:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're picking up some hull ionization.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.98,0:41:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got it。Rough air ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in for some chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.42,0:42:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many drops is this for you，Lieutenant？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.09,0:42:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.59,0:42:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.63,0:42:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many combat drops？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.84,0:42:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，two… including this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.97,0:42:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shit。- Oh，man！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.99,0:42:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Range 014。Turning on final.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.08,0:42:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm telling you，I got a bad feeling about this drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.04,0:42:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You always say that，Frost。You always say，「I got a bad feeling about this drop.」
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.55,0:43:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，okay。When we get back without you，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.09,0:43:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll call your folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.35,0:43:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Let's see what we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.56,0:43:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody online。Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.85,0:43:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drake，check your camera。There seems to be a malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.53,0:43:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's better。Pan it around a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.90,0:43:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good。- I'm ready，man。Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.11,0:43:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I am the ultimate badass。- Yeah。That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.28,0:43:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- State-of-the-badass art。You do not want to fuck with me。- Who here's runnin'？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.79,0:43:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.88,0:43:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Ripley，don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.71,0:43:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me and my squad of ultimate badasses will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.93,0:43:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.93,0:43:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.18,0:43:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Independently targeting particle-beam phalanx.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.81,0:43:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fry halfa city with this puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.52,0:43:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got tactical smart missiles，
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.98,0:44:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,phase-plasma pulse rifles，R.P.G.'s.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.48,0:44:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got sonic，electronic ball breakers！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.03,0:44:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got nukes，we got knives，sharp sticks-
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.45,0:44:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knock it off，Hudson。All right，gear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.45,0:44:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two minutes，people。Get hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.33,0:44:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody wake up Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.55,0:44:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Coming around for a 709er.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.10,0:44:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Terminal guidance locked in。- Where's the damn beacon？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.06,0:44:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.74,0:44:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's the atmosphere processor？- Yep，that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.11,0:44:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remarkable piece of machinery。Completely automated.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.49,0:44:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，we manufacture those，by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.67,0:45:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Ferro。Take us in low over the main colony complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.59,0:45:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Storm shutters are sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.76,0:45:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no visible activity。All right。Hold at 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.67,0:45:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Roger。- Give me a slow circle of the complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.49,0:45:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Structure seems intact。They still have power.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.91,0:45:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Ferro。Set down on the landing grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.20,0:45:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Immediate dust off on my clear，then stay on station.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.14,0:45:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Down and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.64,0:45:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten seconds，people。Look sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.85,0:46:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I want a nice，clean dispersal this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.86,0:46:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！Move it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.03,0:46:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head 'em up！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.93,0:46:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,First squad up on line。Hicks，get yours in accord and watch the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.22,0:46:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vasquez，take point。Let's move！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.23,0:46:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.07,0:46:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson，run a bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.58,0:47:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second squad，move up。Flanking positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.58,0:47:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second squad on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.32,0:47:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You set？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.45,0:47:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.89,0:48:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second team，move inside。Hicks，take the upper level.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.84,0:48:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，you copying this？Looks like hits from small-arms fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.93,0:48:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，we got some explosives damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.10,0:48:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's probably seismic survey charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you reading this？Keep it tight，people.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.49,0:49:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Hicks，Hudson，use your motion trackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.27,0:49:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。Not a goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.92,0:49:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quarter and search by twos.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.79,0:49:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay。Dietrich，Frost，you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.92,0:50:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.14,0:50:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！Now！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.26,0:50:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good one，Hudson！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.94,0:51:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，sir，uh，we have a negative situation here。Uh，movin' on，sir
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.12,0:51:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。Wait，tell him to-
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.09,0:51:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks，back up。Pan right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.97,0:51:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There。- You seeing this all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.64,0:51:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks melted。Somebody must have bagged one of Ripley's bad guys here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.27,0:51:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Acid for blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.31,0:51:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you like that，you're gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.08,0:51:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quit screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.87,0:51:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Second squad，what's your status？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.71,0:51:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，we just finished our sweep。Nobody's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.92,0:52:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Roger。- Sir，this place is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.59,0:52:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever happened here，I think we missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.30,0:52:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。The area's secured。Let's go in and see what their computer can tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.39,0:52:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait a minute。It's not secure。- The area's secured，Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.31,0:52:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,First team，head for operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.22,0:52:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hudson，see if you can get their C.P.U。on line。- Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.56,0:52:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hicks，meet me at the south lock。We're coming in。- Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.11,0:52:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's comin' in。I feel safer already.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.49,0:52:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pendejo jerk-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.59,0:52:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，we got the C.P.U。on line。No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.64,0:52:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Stand by in Operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.35,0:52:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.75,0:53:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.62,0:53:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.89,0:53:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，they sealed off this wing at both ends，
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.98,0:53:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,welded the doors and blocked off the stairs with heavy equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.32,0:53:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm。But it looks like the barricade didn't hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.45,0:53:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Any bodies？- No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.66,0:53:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.66,0:53:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must have been a hell ofa fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.20,0:53:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.75,0:54:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，Drake，this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.96,0:54:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should be able to cut through the medlab to Operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.76,0:55:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.52,0:55:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.41,0:55:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are those the same ones that-
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.34,0:55:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Careful，Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.98,0:55:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like love at first sight to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.98,0:55:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he likes you，Burke.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.40,0:55:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two are alive。The rest are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.91,0:56:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Surgically removed before embryo implantation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.95,0:56:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Subject Marachek，John J.，died during the procedure.「
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.75,0:56:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,They killed him taking it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.25,0:56:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo，Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.51,0:56:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we got something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.80,0:56:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Behind us。- One of us？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.06,0:56:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Apone，where are your people？Anybody in 「D」 block？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.64,0:56:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，that's a negative。We're all in Operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.48,0:56:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk to me，Frosty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.61,0:56:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's keep moving，baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.01,0:56:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's moving。- Which way？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.05,0:57:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's coming straight for us。Straight up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.13,0:57:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuck！- Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.68,0:57:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.70,0:58:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Shh。It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.91,0:58:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's all right。- Come on。Just grab her，Corporal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.25,0:58:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid。Come on。We won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.42,0:58:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shh。It's all right。It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.79,0:58:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on out。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.05,0:58:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Easy。Easy。- I got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.21,0:58:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ow！Damn！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.22,0:58:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Watch her！- She's under the grille！Don't let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.09,0:58:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Frost，get your light up here。- Where'd she go？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.31,0:58:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Shine the light。- Here。Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.23,0:58:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。Here。There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.02,0:58:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep back。Keep back。Don't scare her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.73,0:58:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Grab her，man。We're gonna lose her。- Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.70,0:58:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kick it out！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.66,0:58:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.48,0:59:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.44,0:59:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.32,0:59:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.49,0:59:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。No，you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.49,0:59:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's okay。- You're gonna be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.04,0:59:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.20,0:59:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy。Easy。It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.46,0:59:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.05,0:59:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shh，shh，shh，shh，shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.17,0:59:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy。Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.25,1:00:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's her name again？- Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.84,1:00:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now think，Rebecca。Concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.88,1:00:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just start at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.80,1:00:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are your parents？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.93,1:00:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，look，Rebecca，you have to try and help-
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.23,1:00:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gorman，give it a rest，why don't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.19,1:00:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Total brain lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Physically，she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.03,1:00:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Borderline malnutrition，but I don't think there's any permanent damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.32,1:00:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。We're wasting our time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.29,1:01:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.71,1:01:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a little hot chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.55,1:01:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.05,1:01:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whoop.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.35,1:01:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That good，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.69,1:01:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-oh。I made a clean spot here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.23,1:01:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I've done it。Guess l'll have to do the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.58,1:01:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hard to believe there's a little girl under all this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.12,1:01:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,And a pretty one too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.34,1:01:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't talk much，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.93,1:02:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Smoking or nonsmoking？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.98,1:02:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just tell me what you're scanning for，Private.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.98,1:02:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- P.D.T.s。- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.98,1:02:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Personal data transmitters.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.98,1:02:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Every colonist had one surgically implanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.61,1:02:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they're within 20 klicks，we'll read it out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.86,1:02:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,So far，zippo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.12,1:02:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know how you managed to stay alive，
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.12,1:02:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you're one brave kid，Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.50,1:02:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,N-Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.46,1:02:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What'd you say？- Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.05,1:02:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,My name's Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.34,1:02:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody calls me Rebecca except my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.56,1:02:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt？I like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.52,1:02:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Ripley。It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.32,1:02:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And who is this，hmm？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.53,1:02:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Casey。- Hello，Casey.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.32,1:02:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about your brother？What's his name？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.37,1:02:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Timmy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.49,1:03:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is Timmy around here too？Maybe hiding like you were？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.00,1:03:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any sisters？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.59,1:03:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mom and dad？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.35,1:03:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt，look at me。Where are they？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.68,1:03:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're dead，all right？Can I go now？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.86,1:03:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you think you'd be safer here with us？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.87,1:03:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,These people are here to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.99,1:03:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.04,1:03:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,It won't make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.34,1:03:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Need anything else？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.93,1:04:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Bishop。Do you need anything else？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.77,1:04:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.90,1:04:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's a nice pet you got there，Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.11,1:04:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magnificent，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.11,1:04:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yo！Stop your grinnin' and drop your linen！Found 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.24,1:04:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They alive？- Unknown，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.87,1:04:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,but it looks like all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.87,1:04:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over at the processing station，Sublevel 3，
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.13,1:04:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,under the main cooling towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.80,1:04:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like a goddamn town meeting.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.51,1:04:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's saddle up，Apone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.51,1:04:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aye，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.89,1:04:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Let's go，people。They ain't payin' us by the hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.56,1:04:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Head 'em out！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.60,1:04:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，Frost，you're driving.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.41,1:05:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。Don't worry。It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.41,1:05:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want a straight 「V」 deployment，second team on left flank.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.50,1:05:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Advance on axial 664。Tracker on line.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.62,1:05:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Set the 「V」 gain to filter R.F。ambient.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.84,1:05:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson，tracker on line。Left and right，little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.17,1:06:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forty meters in，bearing 221 ，there should be a stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.43,1:06:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check。Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.85,1:06:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want Sublevel 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.98,1:06:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，people。Hudson，you got the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.31,1:06:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks，watch our tails.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.77,1:06:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice and easy。Check those corners.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.03,1:06:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check those corners.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.66,1:06:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Watch your spacing。- All right。You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.37,1:06:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't bunch up。Stay loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.37,1:06:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，your transmission's showing a lot ofbreakup.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.21,1:06:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Probably getting some interference from the structure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.80,1:06:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use those lights.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.71,1:06:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Next one down，and proceed on a 216.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.18,1:06:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，roger。That's a 216.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.56,1:06:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not making that out too well。What is it，Hudson？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.64,1:06:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You tell me，man。I only work here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.70,1:07:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.87,1:07:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.79,1:07:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Proceed inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.89,1:07:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your fire and check your targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.85,1:07:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember we're looking for civvies in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.99,1:07:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.99,1:07:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tighten it up，Frost。We're getting a little thin.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.25,1:07:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.84,1:08:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like some sort of secreted resin.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.84,1:08:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but secreted from what？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.72,1:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody touch nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.47,1:08:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Busy little creatures，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.51,1:08:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hot as hell in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.85,1:08:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，man，but it's a dry heat.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.85,1:08:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Knock it off，Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.74,1:08:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant，what do those pulse rifles fire？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.16,1:08:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten millimeter explosive-tip caseless.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.62,1:08:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Standard light armor-piercing round.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.77,1:08:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why？- Well，look where your team is.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.11,1:08:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're right under the primary heat exchangers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.44,1:08:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,So？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.53,1:08:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if they fire their weapons in there，won't they rupture the cooling system？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.32,1:08:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ho，ho，ho。Yeah。She's absolutely right。- So？So what？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.66,1:08:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。This whole station is basically a big fusion reactor.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.96,1:08:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.42,1:09:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you're talking about a thermonuclear explosion，and adios，muchachos.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.17,1:09:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，great。Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.88,1:09:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.64,1:09:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。Uh… Apone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.81,1:09:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。We can't have any firing in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.32,1:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I，uh，I want you to collect magazines from everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.15,1:09:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is he fuckin' crazy？- What the hell are we supposed to use，man，harsh language？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.28,1:09:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Flame units only。I want rifles slung。- Sir，I-
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.20,1:09:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just do it，Sergeant。And no grenades.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.87,1:09:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，sweethearts。You heard the man。Pull 'em out。Come on。Let's have 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.96,1:09:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，Vasquez。Clear and lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.55,1:09:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.93,1:09:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You too。Give it up，Ski。Come on。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowe，I want it now。Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.18,1:09:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right on，Vas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go，marine。Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.40,1:09:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frost，you got the duty。Open that bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:10:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Thanks a lot，Sarge。- Hicks，cover our ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.57,1:10:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Head 'em out，people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.57,1:10:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like to keep this handy… for close encounters.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.24,1:10:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.09,1:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any movement？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.09,1:10:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。Zip.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.70,1:10:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt，go sit up front.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.29,1:10:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on！Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.44,1:11:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Steady，people。Let's finish our sweep.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.28,1:11:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're still marines，and we got a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.78,1:11:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Keep it moving。- Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.49,1:12:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help！- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.20,1:12:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Top，get over here。We got a live one！- You're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.03,1:12:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please… k-kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.29,1:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just stay calm。We're gonna get you outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.25,1:12:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's gonna be all right。Give me a hand。We gotta get her outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.92,1:12:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it，Dietrich？- Convulsion！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.38,1:12:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dietrich，get back！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.13,1:12:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.64,1:12:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No！- Frost，flamethrower。Kill it！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.02,1:12:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get back！- Flamethrower！Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.47,1:13:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Movement！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.26,1:13:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's the position？- I can't lock in！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.10,1:13:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk to me，Hudson！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.56,1:13:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Multiple signals.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.81,1:13:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.02,1:13:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go to infrared，people。Look sharp！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.40,1:13:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's happening，Apone？Can't see anything in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.82,1:13:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull your team out，Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.58,1:13:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got signals。I got readings in front and behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.42,1:13:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where，man？I don't see shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.71,1:13:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's right。There's nothing back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.30,1:13:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I'm telling you。There's something moving，and it ain't us！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.80,1:13:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，shit。- Tracker's off scale，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.89,1:14:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're all around us，man！Jesus！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.26,1:14:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe they don't show up on infrared at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.44,1:14:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frost！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.03,1:14:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.46,1:14:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus Christ，Apone！What is going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.13,1:14:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wierzbowski and Crowe are down！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.17,1:14:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dietrich，Crowe！- Sound off！Frost！Dietrich，Frost
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.60,1:14:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Frost！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.51,1:14:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wierzbowski？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.14,1:14:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wierzbowski？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.98,1:14:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's rock！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.36,1:14:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's firing？Goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.32,1:15:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I ordered to hold fire。- They're coming out of the walls！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.45,1:15:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're coming out of the goddamn walls！Let's book！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.91,1:15:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- On the right，man。- Uh，Apone，
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.21,1:15:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you to lay down a suppressing fire with the incinerators-
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.04,1:15:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vasquez，Drake，hold your fire，goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.88,1:15:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Apone，are you copying me？I want you to lay down suppressing fire…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.88,1:15:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,with the incinerators and fall back by squads to the A.P.C.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.51,1:15:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over。Say again，all after 「incinerator.」
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.97,1:15:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said I want you to lay down a suppressing fire with the incinerators and fall back…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.77,1:15:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,by squads to the A.P.C。Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.23,1:15:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.23,1:15:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sarge！Sarge！- Apone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.74,1:15:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Talk to me。Apone？Copy！Copy！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.24,1:15:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Talk to me，Apone。- He's gone！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get them out of there！- Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.70,1:15:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do it now！Hicks，whoever's left，get - Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.71,1:15:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just shut up！Goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.71,1:15:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's coming out of the goddamn walls！Where's Apone？Where's Apone？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.21,1:15:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sarge is gone！Let's get the fuck out of here！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.59,1:16:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's move it！- Let's go，marine！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.47,1:16:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson？Vasquez？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.68,1:16:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson，look out！Get it！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.89,1:16:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch it！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.98,1:16:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hicks。- Come on。Behind you！Fall back！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.48,1:16:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I told them to fall back。- Fall back，goddamn it，now！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.07,1:16:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're cut off！- Hudson，move your ass！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.07,1:16:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Do something！- Let's go，marine！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.03,1:16:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.12,1:16:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。Keep moving，baby。- Hold on，Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.87,1:16:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，what the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.05,1:16:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn around！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.14,1:16:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's an order！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.02,1:16:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get off me，damn it！- Goddamn it，that's an order！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.56,1:16:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You had your chance，Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.62,1:17:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.10,1:17:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's move it！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.81,1:17:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Let's go！Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.23,1:17:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's blocked，man。We gotta go around！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Open the door！Hicks！- Drake，we are leaving！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.66,1:17:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get them，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.53,1:17:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run for it！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.20,1:17:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shit！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.42,1:17:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Go！Go！- Come on，man！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.76,1:18:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Drake，come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.18,1:18:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.48,1:18:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fire in the hole！- He's gone！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.40,1:18:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put it out！Put it out！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.36,1:18:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Come on。Put it out！- Drake's coming，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.20,1:18:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- He's gone！- Drake！No，he's not！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.58,1:18:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forget him！He's gone！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.38,1:18:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're in the goddamn door！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.72,1:18:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eat this！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.68,1:18:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go，go，go！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.79,1:19:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right！We're clear！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.79,1:20:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，you've blown the transaxle！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.29,1:20:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're just grinding metal！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.29,1:20:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，ease down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.59,1:20:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ease down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.71,1:20:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ease down。Ease down。Ease down.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.15,1:20:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.77,1:20:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,l'm all right。Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.90,1:20:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get away from me，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.07,1:20:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lieutenant。What happened to Gorman？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.16,1:20:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。Maybe a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.49,1:20:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But he's alive。- He's dead！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.87,1:20:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake up，pendejo，and then I'm gonna kill you！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.04,1:20:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back off。Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.71,1:20:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck！Somebody get me a first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.97,1:20:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。Hey，look.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.18,1:20:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sarge and Dietrich aren't dead，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.56,1:20:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their signs are real low，but they ain't dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.64,1:21:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Then we go back in there and get them。- Fuck that！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.02,1:21:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We don't leave our people behind - I ain't going back in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.48,1:21:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't help them！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.02,1:21:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't。Right now they're being cocooned just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.99,1:21:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，dear Lord Jesus，this ain't happenin'，man。- Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.33,1:21:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,This can't be happenin'，man。This isn't happenin'！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.50,1:21:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We got seven canisters of CN-20.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.13,1:21:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say we roll them in there and nerve gas the whole fucking nest.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.55,1:21:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's worth a try，but we don't even know if it's gonna affect them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.42,1:21:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's just bug out and call it even。Okay？- What are we talking about this for？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.97,1:21:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say we take off and nuke the entire site from orbit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.56,1:21:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the only way to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.56,1:21:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuckin' 「A」！- Hold on。Hold on one second.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.90,1:21:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,This installation has a substantial dollar value attached to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.15,1:21:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can bill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.74,1:22:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，look。This is an emotional moment for all of us，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.87,1:22:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know that。But let's not make snap judgments，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.37,1:22:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is clearly-clearly an important species we're dealing with，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.42,1:22:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I don't think that you or I or anybody has the right…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.25,1:22:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- to arbitrarily exterminate them。- Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.42,1:22:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Watch us.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.05,1:22:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you haven't been keeping up on current events，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.43,1:22:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we just got our asses kicked，pal！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.18,1:22:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。I'm not blind to what's going on，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.60,1:22:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I cannot authorize that kind of action.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.27,1:22:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.48,1:22:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I believe Corporal Hicks…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.48,1:22:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,has authority here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.95,1:22:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Corporal Hicks is-
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.95,1:22:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,This operation is under military jurisdiction，
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.41,1:22:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,and Hicks is next in chain of command.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.41,1:22:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Am I right，Corporal？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.66,1:22:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.79,1:22:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.42,1:22:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Look，Ripley。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.55,1:22:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a multimillion-dollar installation，okay？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.09,1:22:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,He can't make that kind of decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.09,1:22:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's just a grunt。Uh，no offense.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.76,1:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- None taken。Ferro，do you copy？- Standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.60,1:23:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prep for dust off。We're gonna need immediate evac.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.35,1:23:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Roger。On our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.35,1:23:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say we take off，nuke the site from orbit。It's the only way to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.61,1:23:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.45,1:23:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Pick it up，Hudson。Pick it up，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.21,1:23:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Set him down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.97,1:23:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move it，Spunkmeyer。We're rolling.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.19,1:23:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on a second。There's something-
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.19,1:23:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just get up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.57,1:23:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in。Ramp closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.80,1:24:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Spunkmeyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.97,1:24:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.72,1:24:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，where the fuck-
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.82,1:24:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.61,1:25:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's great。That's just fuckin' great，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.49,1:25:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now what the fuck are we supposed to do？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.03,1:25:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in some real pretty shit now，man！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.41,1:25:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you finished？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.62,1:25:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.80,1:25:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess we're not gonna be leaving now，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.09,1:25:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.80,1:25:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't have to be sorry。It wasn't your fault。That's it，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.81,1:25:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Game over，man！Game over！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.27,1:25:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the fuck are we gonna do now？What are we gonna do？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.98,1:26:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe we could build a fire。Sing a couple of songs，huh？Why don't we try that？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.48,1:26:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'd better get back 'cause it'll be dark soon，
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.32,1:26:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they mostly come at night，mostly.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.51,1:26:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's everything，right？All right。This is absolutely everything…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.60,1:26:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,that we could salvage out of the A.P.C。wreckage.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.68,1:26:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got four pulse rifles with about 50 rounds each.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.35,1:26:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That ain't so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.56,1:26:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got，uh，15 of these M-40 grenades.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.40,1:26:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dangerous，honey。- Is that the only flamethrower？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.95,1:26:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。It's only half full，but it's functional.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.08,1:26:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got another one，it's damaged-I don't know about that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.91,1:26:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,But the good news-we got four of these robot sentries，
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.79,1:27:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,with display and scanners intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.92,1:27:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,They really kick ass。I think they'll come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.17,1:27:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long after we're declared overdue can we expect a rescue？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.64,1:27:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventeen days.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.77,1:27:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventeen days？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.40,1:27:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，man，I don't wanna rain on your parade，but we're not gonna last 17 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.36,1:27:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those things are gonna come in here like they did before。They're gonna come in here-
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.11,1:27:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hudson！Hudson！- They're gonna come in here and they're gonna get us！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.28,1:27:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,This little girl survived longer than that…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.41,1:27:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,with no weapons and no training.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.54,1:27:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.83,1:27:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you put her in charge？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.03,1:27:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd better just start dealing with it，Hudson。Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.55,1:27:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson，just deal with it because we need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.80,1:27:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I'm sick of your bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.80,1:27:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，I want you to get on a terminal and call up some kind of floor plan file.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.47,1:27:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you understand？Construction blueprints。I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.27,1:27:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything that shows the layout of this place。Are you listening？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.73,1:28:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah。- I need to see air ducts.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.90,1:28:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to see electrical access tunnels，subbasements，
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.36,1:28:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,every possible way into this complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.15,1:28:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We don't have much time。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.74,1:28:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，I'm on it。- Hudson！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.12,1:28:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.21,1:28:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be in medlab。I'll check on Gorman，continue my analysis.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.34,1:28:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fine。You do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.47,1:28:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,So this service tunnel must be how they're moving back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.39,1:28:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。It moves from the processing station…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.98,1:28:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,right into the sublevel here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.36,1:28:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come down on that。Okay，come over.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.78,1:28:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold。Go back。Okay，punch that in right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.66,1:29:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。It's back here。- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.25,1:29:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there's a pressure door at this end.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.00,1:29:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Couldn't we put one of the remote sentry units in the tunnel and then seal that door？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.72,1:29:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that'll work，but we gotta figure on them getting into the complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.80,1:29:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，so we repair the barricades at these two intersections.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.93,1:29:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。And weld plate steel over these ducts…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.69,1:29:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,here and here and here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.15,1:29:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,That way they can only come at us from these two corridors.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.24,1:29:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Then we put the other sentry units here and here，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.03,1:29:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right。- Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.58,1:29:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now all we need is a deck of cards.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.83,1:29:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，people。Let's move like we got a purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.04,1:29:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Affirmative。- Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.06,1:30:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do your thing，baby。Come on，Vasquez。Let's get the hell outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.81,1:30:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson here。「A」 and 「B」 sentries are in place and keyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.77,1:30:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Roger。Stand by。Arming now。- Test it，Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.74,1:30:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do it！Fire in the hole！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.37,1:30:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，great。Let's get the hell outta here！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.25,1:30:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're sealing the tunnel。Come on，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.89,1:30:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,For what it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.77,1:30:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。I want you to put this on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.44,1:30:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's it for？- It's a locator.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.77,1:30:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then I can find you anywhere in the complex on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.07,1:30:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's just a precaution。- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.24,1:31:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doesn't mean we're engaged or anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.12,1:31:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，what's next？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.73,1:31:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Last stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.78,1:31:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.78,1:31:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scoot down。That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.95,1:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，you lie here and have a nap。You're very tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.08,1:31:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to。I have scary dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.84,1:31:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I bet Casey doesn't have scary dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.01,1:31:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.01,1:32:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nope。Nothing bad in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.43,1:32:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,See？Maybe you could just try to be like her，hmm？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.81,1:32:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，she doesn't have bad dreams…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.39,1:32:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,because she's just a piece of plastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.52,1:32:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。I'm sorry，Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.74,1:32:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.08,1:32:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,My mommy always said there were no monsters…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.04,1:32:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,no real ones-but there are.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.71,1:32:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，there are，aren't there？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.75,1:32:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why do they tell little kids that？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.97,1:32:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most of the time it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.97,1:32:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did one of those things grow inside her？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.51,1:32:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know，Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.39,1:32:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.44,1:32:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Isn't that how babies come？I mean，people babies？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.15,1:32:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They grow inside you。- Oh，that's very different.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.78,1:33:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you ever have a baby？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.78,1:33:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I did。I had a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.20,1:33:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where is she？- She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.58,1:33:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.13,1:33:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.46,1:33:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.80,1:33:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,For luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.97,1:33:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.10,1:33:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't go，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.10,1:33:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt，I'm gonna be right in the next room.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.73,1:33:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you see that camera right up there？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.73,1:33:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can see you right through that camera，
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.61,1:33:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,all the time to see if you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.33,1:33:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna leave you，Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.08,1:33:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean that。That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.08,1:33:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,You promise？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.83,1:33:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I cross my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.21,1:34:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And hope to die？- And hope to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.40,1:34:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now go to sleep，and don't dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.03,1:34:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sneak.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.75,1:34:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,The molecular acid oxidizes after the creature's death，completely neutralizing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.09,1:34:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop，you know，that's very interesting，but it doesn't really get us anywhere，does it？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.59,1:34:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying to figure out what we're dealing with here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.22,1:34:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go through it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.39,1:34:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,They grab the colonists，they move them over there…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.68,1:34:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,and they immobilize them to be hosts for more of these.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.10,1:35:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which would mean that there would have to be a lot of these parasites，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.02,1:35:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,One for each colonist。That's over 100，at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.28,1:35:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。That follows.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.28,1:35:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,But each one of these things comes from an egg，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.87,1:35:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,So who's laying these eggs？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.87,1:35:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.04,1:35:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must be something we haven't seen yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.08,1:35:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，maybe it's like an ant hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.38,1:35:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bees，man。Bees have hives.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.50,1:35:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what I mean。There's，like，one female that runs the whole show.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.76,1:35:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yes，the queen。- Ueah，the mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.22,1:35:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's badass，man。I mean，big.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.68,1:35:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,These things ain't ants，estupido。I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.31,1:35:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop，I want these specimens destroyed as soon as you're finished with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.06,1:35:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is that clear？- Mr。Burke gave instructions…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.07,1:35:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,that they were to be kept alive in stasis for return to the company labs.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.25,1:35:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was very specific about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.63,1:35:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。Those two specimens are worth millions to the bio-weapons division，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.72,1:36:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，if you're smart，we can both come out of this heroes，
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.18,1:36:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,and we will be set up for life.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.44,1:36:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're crazy，Burke。Do you know that？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.11,1:36:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you really think you can get a dangerous organism like that past I.C.C。quarantine？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.36,1:36:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,How can they impound it if they don't know about it？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.32,1:36:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they will know about it，Burke，from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.45,1:36:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just like they'll know that you were responsible for the deaths of 157 colonists.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.79,1:36:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait a second。- You sent them to that ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.33,1:36:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're wrong。- I just checked the colony log.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.50,1:36:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Directive dated 6-12-79，signed Burke，Carter J.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.46,1:36:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sent them out there，and you didn't even warn them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.51,1:36:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why didn't you warn them，Burke？- Okay，look.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.01,1:36:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if that ship didn't even exist？Do you ever think about that？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.60,1:36:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't know。So now if I went and made a major security situation out of it，
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.39,1:36:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,everybody steps in，administration steps in，and there's no exclusive rights for anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.85,1:36:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody wins。So I made a decision，and it was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.98,1:36:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was a bad call，Ripley。It was a bad call.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.82,1:36:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Bad call？- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.57,1:36:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,These people are dead，Burke！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.28,1:36:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you have any idea what you've done here？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.78,1:37:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make sure that they nail you right to the wall for this！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.79,1:37:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not gonna sleaze your way out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.12,1:37:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right to the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.13,1:37:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley。I-
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.25,1:37:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I expected more from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.34,1:37:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be smarter than this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.38,1:37:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'm happy to disappoint you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.36,1:37:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What is it？What's going on？- They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.86,1:37:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where？- In the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.87,1:37:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here we go。「A」 and 「B」 gun tracking far end。Multiple targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.01,1:37:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those ammo counters go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.55,1:37:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「B」 gun's down 50%…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.85,1:38:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，it's a shooting gallery down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.06,1:38:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sixty rounds left on 「B.」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.90,1:38:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Forty。Twenty。Ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.15,1:38:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「B」 gun's dry。Twenty on 「A.」
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.65,1:38:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten。Five.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.74,1:38:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.50,1:38:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus，they were wall-to-wall in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.71,1:38:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're at the pressure door.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.30,1:38:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Man，listen to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.34,1:38:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop here。I'm afraid I have some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.10,1:38:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's a switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.18,1:38:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's very pretty，Bishop，but what are we looking for？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.06,1:38:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it。Emergency venting.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.69,1:38:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，that's beautiful，man。Oh，man，that-that just beats it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.44,1:38:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How long till it blows？- Four hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.40,1:39:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,With a blast radius of 30 kilometers，
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.53,1:39:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,equal to about 40 megatons.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.29,1:39:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We got problems。- I don't believe this。I don't fucking believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.83,1:39:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vasquez，close the shutters.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.42,1:39:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why can't we shut it down from here？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.67,1:39:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。The crash caused too much damage.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.67,1:39:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,An overload is inevitable at this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.30,1:39:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，man，and I was getting short.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.30,1:39:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four more weeks and out。Now l'm gonna buy it on this rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.76,1:39:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It ain't half fair，man。- Hudson，give us a break！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.89,1:39:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Four more weeks。Oh，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.56,1:39:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to get the other drop ship from the Sulaco.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.86,1:39:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，there must be some way of bringing it down on remote.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.90,1:39:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,How？The transmitter was on the A.P.C。It's wasted.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.53,1:39:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care how，but we'd better think of something。We'd better think of a way.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.87,1:39:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Think of what？We're fucked！We're doomed！- Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.79,1:39:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up！What about the colony transmitters？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.66,1:39:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,The uplink tower down at the other end。Why can't we use that？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.54,1:39:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I checked。The hardware in between here and there was damaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.59,1:39:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't align the dish.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.59,1:39:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，somebody's gonna have to go out there，
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.09,1:40:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,take a portable terminal，go out there and patch in manually.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.09,1:40:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah，sure。With those things running around？You can count me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.27,1:40:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Guess we can just count you out of everything。- I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.35,1:40:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right，man。Why don't you go，man？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.27,1:40:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll go。- What？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.19,1:40:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll go。I mean，I'm the only one qualified to remote pilot the ship anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.61,1:40:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Yeah，right，man。Bishop should go。- Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.07,1:40:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Believe me，I'd prefer not to.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.32,1:40:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I may be synthetic，but I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.01,1:40:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.01,1:40:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,This conduit runs almost to the uplink assembly-180 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.39,1:40:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Say 40 minutes to crawl down there - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.76,1:40:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,An hour to patch in and align the antenna.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.60,1:40:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thirty minutes to prep the ship，
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.98,1:40:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,and about 50 minutes flight time。It's gonna be close.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.70,1:41:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Good luck。- See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.87,1:41:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.86,1:41:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vaya con Dios，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.84,1:41:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable。Twenty meters and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.56,1:41:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fifteen。- How many？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.73,1:41:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't tell。Lots.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.90,1:41:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「D」 gun's down 50%…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.19,1:41:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「C」 gun's right behind it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.28,1:41:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stopping them。It ain't stopping them.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.54,1:41:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 150 rounds on 「D.」 - Come on。Come on，baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.62,1:41:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hundred rounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.00,1:42:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.51,1:42:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「D」 gun's down to 20.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.26,1:42:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.93,1:42:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn it！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.97,1:42:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！They're retreating.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.23,1:42:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guns stopped them.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.82,1:42:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.16,1:42:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Next time they walk right up and knock.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.17,1:42:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but they don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.21,1:42:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're probably looking for other ways to get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.00,1:42:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'll take 'em a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.01,1:42:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Maybe we got 'em demoralized。- Shut up！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.84,1:42:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you two walking perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.89,1:42:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.69,1:43:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.98,1:43:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all in strung-out shape，
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.99,1:43:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,but stay frosty and alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.70,1:43:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't afford to let one of those bastards in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.66,1:43:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Vamonos.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.72,1:43:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long's it been since you got any sleep？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.80,1:43:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twenty-four hours？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.51,1:43:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks，I'm not gonna end up like those others.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.89,1:43:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll take care of it，won't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.31,1:43:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,If it comes to that，I'll do us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.57,1:43:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，let's just make sure it doesn't come to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.40,1:43:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All right？- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.08,1:44:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I want to introduce you to a personal friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.37,1:44:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is an M-41A pulse rifle，10 millimeter，
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.38,1:44:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,with an over-and-under 30 millimeter pump-action grenade launcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.30,1:44:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Feel the weight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.18,1:44:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，what do I do？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.90,1:44:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Okay，pull it in tight here。- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.65,1:44:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh-huh。Lean into it。Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.03,1:44:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Now，it will kick some.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.78,1:44:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。When the counter reads zero here，you-
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.45,1:44:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I press this up？- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.79,1:44:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get another one in quick。Slap it in hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.04,1:44:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right。And you're ready to rock and roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.17,1:44:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's this？- That's the grenade launcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.65,1:44:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think you want to mess with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.88,1:44:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,You started this。Show me everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.97,1:44:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can handle myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.52,1:45:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.61,1:45:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,How do you feel？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.65,1:45:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，I guess。One hell of a hangover.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.70,1:45:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look，Ripley，I just want - Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.00,1:45:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.97,1:46:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shh，shh，shh，shh，shh。It's okay。It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.46,1:47:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt，wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.96,1:47:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wha-Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.97,1:47:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.49,1:48:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.36,1:48:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move，Newt！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.51,1:48:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.44,1:48:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！Help！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.86,1:48:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hicks！- Somebody！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.90,1:48:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say again，Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.91,1:48:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've got it into auto-refuel mode，and it's sequencing right？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.37,1:48:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。Okay，good。Stay on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.50,1:48:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back to me when you've activated the launch cycle.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.12,1:48:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Roger。- He's at the uplink tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.50,1:49:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.71,1:49:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hicks！Hicks！Hicks！- Help！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.80,1:49:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Help！Help！- Hicks，help us！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.47,1:49:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Break the glass！Break it。Break it。- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.64,1:49:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.91,1:49:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.46,1:49:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.92,1:49:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.73,1:50:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the medlab。Hudson！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.86,1:50:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vasquez，meet me in medlab。We got a fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.28,1:50:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.16,1:50:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're coming，Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.73,1:50:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shoot it out！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.82,1:50:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hudson！- Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.29,1:50:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Christ，kid，look out！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.55,1:51:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fucking die.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.43,1:51:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Over there！Ready？- Yeah！Yeah！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.73,1:51:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.86,1:51:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hudson？- Yeah。All clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.86,1:51:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nailed the other one。It's history，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.82,1:51:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.91,1:51:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Burke-It was Burke.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.75,1:51:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I say we grease this rat-fuck son of a bitch right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.04,1:51:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just doesn't make any goddamn sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.93,1:51:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,He figured that he could get an alien back through quarantine…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.05,1:51:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,if one of us was impregnated…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.06,1:52:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,whatever you call it…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.35,1:52:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then frozen for the trip home.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.02,1:52:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody would know about the embryos we were carrying…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.15,1:52:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,me and Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.03,1:52:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute，now。We'd all know.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.07,1:52:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。The only way he could do it…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.41,1:52:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,is if he sabotaged certain freezers on the way home.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.25,1:52:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Namely yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.92,1:52:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then he could jettison the bodies and make up any story he liked.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.88,1:52:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fuck！He's dead。- You're dog meat，pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.26,1:52:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is so nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.26,1:52:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，listen-Listen to what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.97,1:52:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's paranoid delusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.73,1:52:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's really sad。It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.15,1:52:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，Burke，I don't know which species is worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.03,1:52:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't see them fucking each other over for a goddamn percentage.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.40,1:52:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We waste him。No offense.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.62,1:52:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！He's gotta go back-
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.45,1:53:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They cut the power。- What do you mean，they cut the power？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.16,1:53:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,How could they cut the power，man？They're animals.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.83,1:53:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want you two with trackers，checking the corridors！Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.50,1:53:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Gorman，watch Burke！- I got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.50,1:53:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt，stay close.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.30,1:53:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'll go this side。- You do that，man.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.12,1:53:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Anything？- There's something.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.00,1:53:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's inside the complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.29,1:53:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're just reading me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.25,1:53:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，no，it ain't you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.34,1:53:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're inside-inside the perimeter。They're in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.09,1:54:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson，stay cool！Vasquez？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.31,1:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson may be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.02,1:54:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get back，both of you！- The signal's weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.53,1:54:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Must be some interference or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.28,1:54:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's movement all over the place！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.28,1:54:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Get back to Operations。- It's game time.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.70,1:54:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.62,1:54:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seal the door。Hurry！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.58,1:54:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！Come on！Get back！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.13,1:54:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Work fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.43,1:54:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cover your eyes，Newt。Don't look at the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.68,1:54:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Movement。Signal's clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.77,1:54:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Range，20 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.77,1:54:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,They found a way in，something we missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.02,1:54:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,We didn't miss anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.02,1:54:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eighteen。Seventeen meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.90,1:54:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something under the floor，not in the plans。I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.36,1:55:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Fifteen meters。- Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.53,1:55:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Definitely inside the barricades。- Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.66,1:55:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thirteen meters。That's right outside the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.66,1:55:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks，Vasquez，get back！This is a big fucking signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.37,1:55:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How you doing，Vasquez？Talk to me。- Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.21,1:55:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.67,1:55:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Twelve meters。Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.05,1:55:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ten。- Then they're right on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.64,1:55:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nine meters。- Remember-short，controlled bursts.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.97,1:55:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eight meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.31,1:55:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.07,1:55:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Six。- It can't be。That's inside the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.07,1:55:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's reading right，man。Look！- Well，you're not reading it right.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.70,1:55:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Five meters，man。Four。- What the hell？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.96,1:55:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my God。Oh，sh-Give me the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.14,1:56:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,There they go！Over there！Get them！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.65,1:56:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Get them！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.44,1:56:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do something，Gorman！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.86,1:56:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get them！Look out！There's more of them！There's more of them！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.66,1:56:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Medical！Get to Medical！Do it！Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.87,1:56:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson，look out！Look out！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.04,1:56:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.42,1:56:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Burke！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.68,1:56:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open this door！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.64,1:56:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Burke！Open it！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.52,1:56:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Fall back！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.40,1:56:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.69,1:57:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Die，motherfucker！- Burke！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.61,1:57:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson！Hudson！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.28,1:57:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Motherfucker！Come on！Come on！Come and get it，baby！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.37,1:57:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't got all day！Come on！Come on！Come on，you bastard！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.12,1:57:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！You too！Oh，you want some of this？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.96,1:57:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.21,1:57:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fuck you！Hicks！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.05,1:57:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hudson！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.81,1:57:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.81,1:57:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's locked！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.37,1:58:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Got it！Let's go！Let's go！- Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.71,1:58:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Move，Gorman！- Seal it！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.63,1:58:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Burke！Goddamn you！Open this door！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.94,1:58:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.61,1:58:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hurry up。- Gorman，get out of the way！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.99,1:58:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley，this way！What-
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.07,1:58:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait。Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.03,1:58:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you're gonna do，do it fast！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.46,1:58:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks！Go！Come on。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.96,1:58:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.43,1:58:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which way is it to the landing field from here？- This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.52,1:59:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go right.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.61,1:59:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way。This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.20,1:59:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which way？- Straight ahead and left.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.75,1:59:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop，do you read me？Come in。Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.42,1:59:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ship is on its way.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.38,1:59:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,E.T.A.，16 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.55,1:59:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by there。We're on our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.60,1:59:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Which way now？- That way.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.65,1:59:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No，wait。This way。- You sure？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.28,1:59:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vasquez，move！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.74,1:59:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Right up here。It's just up here。- Hicks！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.99,1:59:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.95,2:00:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt，wait！Newt！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.23,2:00:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vasquez！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.27,2:00:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.74,2:00:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.50,2:00:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.92,2:00:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Up there。There's a shortcut across the roof.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.34,2:00:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.85,2:01:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,You always were an asshole，Gorman.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.37,2:01:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Newt！God！- Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.67,2:01:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.00,2:01:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks！Hicks，get her！Hurry！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.59,2:01:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hold on，Newt！- I'm slipping！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.14,2:01:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't let go。- Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.43,2:01:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hold on。Gotcha！- Help！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.48,2:01:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.02,2:01:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.02,2:01:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.24,2:01:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。We can find her with this.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.16,2:02:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay where you are，Newt。- Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.95,2:02:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're coming.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.26,2:02:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.72,2:02:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.02,2:02:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's close。- Newt！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.02,2:02:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.02,2:02:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you？Can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.86,2:02:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt！Here！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.86,2:02:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm here！- Where？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.12,2:02:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt，are you okay？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.25,2:02:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll have to cut it.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.12,2:02:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Climb down，honey。We've gotta cut through.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.76,2:03:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.76,2:03:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，don't move。Stay very still.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.14,2:03:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.23,2:03:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're almost there。Hang in there，okay？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.07,2:03:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hicks。Hurry。- I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.95,2:03:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know！- I mean it！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.05,2:03:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt？Newt，just stay still.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.18,2:03:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.47,2:03:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.60,2:03:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Newt！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.49,2:04:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.11,2:04:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No！No！No！- Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.32,2:04:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！No！They don't kill you！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.62,2:04:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,They-They don't kill you！They-
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.83,2:04:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's alive！She's alive！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.79,2:04:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。I believe you。She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.29,2:04:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to go。Now！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.85,2:04:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.97,2:04:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hicks。- Get it off！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.95,2:04:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get it off！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.50,2:05:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.60,2:05:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.06,2:05:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。You can make it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.54,2:05:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop，how much time？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.88,2:05:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plenty。Twenty-six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.80,2:05:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're not leaving。- We're not？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.51,2:07:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ripley - I don't wanna hear about it，Bishop。She's alive。There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.97,2:07:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,In 19 minutes，this area is gonna be a cloud of vapor the size of Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.23,2:07:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hicks，don't let him leave。We ain't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.48,2:07:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- See you，Hicks。- Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.61,2:07:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's Dwayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.16,2:07:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.16,2:07:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be gone long，Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.92,2:07:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention。Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.09,2:07:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel must evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.22,2:07:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You now have 15 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.14,2:07:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,to reach minimum safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.73,2:08:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention。Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.27,2:08:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel must evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.57,2:08:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You now have 14 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.41,2:08:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,to reach minimum safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.54,2:12:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Ripley！Ripley！- Newt.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.15,2:12:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grab on to me！Hold on！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.38,2:16:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.34,2:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behind us！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.61,2:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention。Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.53,2:17:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel must evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:56.32,2:17:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention。Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.53,2:18:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel must evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.12,2:18:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,You now have four minutes…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.67,2:18:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,to reach minimum safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.10,2:18:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，goddamn it！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.56,2:18:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold on to me！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.91,2:19:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Attention。Emergency.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.79,2:19:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,All personnel must evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.79,2:19:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You now have two minutes…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.54,2:19:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,to reach minimum safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.26,2:19:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.56,2:19:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop，goddamn you！
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.25,2:20:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close your eyes，baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.88,2:21:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.76,2:21:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.25,2:21:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Punch it，Bishop！
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.05,2:22:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's okay。We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.85,2:22:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.23,2:22:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,We made it.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.82,2:22:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.75,2:23:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's gonna be all right。He's just out.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:04.00,2:23:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to give him another shot for the pain.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.59,2:23:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need a stretcher to carry him up to Medical.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.26,2:23:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.93,2:23:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I scared you。That platform wasjust becoming too unstable.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.02,2:23:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to circle and hope that things didn't get too rough to take you off.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.90,2:23:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop，you did okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.95,2:23:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I did？- Oh，yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.11,2:24:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Move！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.74,2:24:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Here！Here！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.00,2:24:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.29,2:24:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here！
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.63,2:25:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get away from her，you bitch！
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.89,2:26:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！Come on！
Dialogue: 0,2:27:53.00,2:27:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ripley！
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.87,2:29:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bishop！
Dialogue: 0,2:29:55.87,2:29:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mommy。- Oh，God！
Dialogue: 0,2:30:01.75,2:30:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not bad for a h-human.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:52.05,2:30:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are we gonna sleep all the way home？
Dialogue: 0,2:30:55.14,2:30:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- All the way home。- Can I dream？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:00.44,2:31:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，honey。I think we both can.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.28,2:31:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Sleep tight。- Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.70,0:01:16.70,Title,0,0,0,0,,《异形2》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命迹象指数全为绿色，看来她还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只找到她，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天觉得如何？- 糟透了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少比昨天好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是那里？- 你很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已在基地休息了数天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点虚弱，但现在已没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人来拜访你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔西，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？你真是只笨猫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们必定已会过面，卡特巴特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.70,0:06:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是公司的人，别被我骗了，我是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.54,0:06:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.54,0:06:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说你的虚脱很快会好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是过度长眠的自然影响
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.43,0:06:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我漂流了多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸入疗法…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.06,0:06:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有人跟你说过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可真的不认得这地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.65,0:06:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你可能会吓一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因很久了 - 多久了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:07:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 57年 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面漂流了57年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被漂流到航道外
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.76,0:07:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救队能找到你…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经好运
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.97,0:07:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,千分之一的机会率
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.35,0:07:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能活着真是幸运，你可能会永远漂流在外太空
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.41,0:07:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.63,0:07:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 护士，快来！- 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.30,0:07:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 捉住她 - 求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉住她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,又做恶梦了？你需要安眠药吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡够了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.92,0:08:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔西
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.26,0:08:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.34,0:08:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.73,0:08:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫许医生，请到334号！赫许医生，请到334号！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我迟到了，我整个早上都好忙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿有没有消息？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该先谈听证会的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.85,0:09:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们时间不多，我看过你的证供，很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要坚持你的说法，应该不会有问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有很多重要人物到场
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括调查局，星际贸易委员会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,殖民地行政主管，保险公司
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.74,0:09:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有我女儿的消息？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的确查到了一些消息，坐下来谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来想等到审判之后再告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「阿曼达·蕾普莉·麦克伦」，应该是夫姓吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,66岁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她死亡的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是两年前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿曼达
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.91,0:10:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她火葬后埋在威斯康辛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有子女，我查过了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应她，她生日的时候会回家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪她过十一岁生日
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝毁弃条例的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:11:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是不是在文件里？- 我不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿三个半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.78,0:11:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一件事你要我说多少遍？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得替公司着想，请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坦白表示引爆船舰
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此摧毁的太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,价值连城
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,共值四千二百万元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还不包括货物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,救生船记录证实你的部分证供
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不明原因使诺斯托罗莫号迫降LV426
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,该星球不适合生存，太空船再度启程后…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.99,0:11:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,却被你以不明原因自动引爆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是不明原因，我已经说过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们奉公司命令去带回异形，它消灭我的队员…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.25,0:11:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你那艘昂贵的太空船
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析化验小组，地毯式搜索，发现
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你消灭的东西没有生命迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，因为我把它抛出气舱外
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,LV426星球，是否有这种生物存在？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.99,0:12:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，只有岩石，没有生物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我的智商在长眠时衰退了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过，那不是当地的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是外星船
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,异形不是那儿来的，懂吗？我们收到它们的信号
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果找到三百多个报告里…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没有的玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一种活在人体内的怪物 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的说法，它的血液有强酸性，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:13:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我知道发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我要说的是怪物的确存在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢，足够了，蕾普莉 - 拜托，你没听进去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.61,0:13:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯恩是我的队员
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他进去看过，有上千个异形的卵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上千个 - 谢谢你，别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，我还没说完！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有一只侵入，我们就真的完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和这些你认为很重要的废话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,便真的完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,本庭判决…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉军官
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,军籍号码NRC14472
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因做出不当判断…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不适合持有ICC执照，并担任星际飞行官的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们将永久吊销其执照
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前将不会以任何罪名起诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你将接受…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个月的心理治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,并每个月接受ICC心理医师的检查
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,休庭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:18.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（资料封锁）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着，蕾普莉？- 范·卢恩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不查查LV426区？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有这个必要，那里有人工作二十年以上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.00,0:14:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从来没说过有敌人 - 什么意思？什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球改造者，工程师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去装设大气工程，以便有空气呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了十年的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们所说的外星殖民地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少人？有多少殖民地？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，大概有60到70户，借过
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有住户？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到下面维修部去，艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.40,0:16:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事？- 嘿，艾尔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干嘛？- 你记不记得你上个礼拜…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.70,0:16:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人到髂骨区调查的结果？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得，怎么了？- 有人回报说他们找到些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道结果有没有他一份
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为是你派他到那个鬼地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不清楚 - 天啊，我们只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,奉上级的命令行事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也没有解释原因，我也不会多问
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不问是因为要等两个星期才有答案，而答案总是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不要多问」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.06,0:17:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么跟他说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.27,0:17:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他，据我个人意见，他找到的东西就归他
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.61,0:17:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莱特克 - 干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩不可以到这里来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你专门跑到我们去不了的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么样？谁叫我比你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了，别让我再抓到你们两个到不该去玩的地方玩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈，所有的小朋友都…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.58,0:18:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，安妮，过来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次挖到宝了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我们能不能靠近一点看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许还有入口
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.36,0:18:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该先向基地报告吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,先看看这东西到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能靠这么近了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要进去看看？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个留在里面，我们马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂米 他们去了好久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会有事的，爸爸知道他在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.27,0:20:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,求救！求救！AK249呼叫！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,AK249呼叫！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,AK249呼叫！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，蕾普莉，这是殖民地的…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.50,0:21:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈曼中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，我们得谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们与LV426失去联络
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不能相信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.55,0:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们曾丢我去那儿，现在又叫我回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,免谈，这不是我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以说完吗？- 不，没可能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，你不必跟随军队进去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证你的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.49,0:22:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些殖民陆战队都是顶尖的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.67,0:22:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有最尖端的火力装备
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么状况都能应付
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.58,0:22:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中尉，对吗？- 完全正确
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受训练就为了应付这种状况
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.25,0:22:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不需要我，我不是军人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们不知道情况如何
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.67,0:22:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许只是通讯器故障
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是的话，我希望你做我们的顾问
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.93,0:22:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事对你有什么好处？你为什么要去？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个殖民地是我们出资支持的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.02,0:22:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也是我们管理的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.61,0:22:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在要进行广大的开垦计划，建造一个更好的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.23,0:22:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过广告了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间跟你搞，我还有事要做
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了，听说你在货柜码头工作
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:23:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 忙着装货补货吗？- 是呀，怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.21,0:23:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，让自己忙一点很好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你也只能干这种差事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.05,0:23:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没有什么不对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.14,0:23:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能使你再当…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.68,0:23:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行官呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 公司方面同意和你签约 - 只要我肯去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.56,0:23:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，只要你肯去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.61,0:23:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！第二春呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.86,0:23:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我认为必须要去面对…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.70,0:23:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才有机会克服
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.66,0:23:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过我，我刚看过心理医生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，我读过你的报道，你每晚醒来直冒冷汗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.87,0:23:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不就是不！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.92,0:23:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你走吧，我不回去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去对你也没有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:24:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我个忙，考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.15,0:24:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.26,0:25:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.26,0:25:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.10,0:25:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？- 告诉我一件事，巴克
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.73,0:25:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去毁灭它们，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.10,0:25:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是研究，也不是带回来，而是消灭它们
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了，我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.70,0:25:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.30,0:25:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你，小混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.27,0:25:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.70,0:28:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们这次付的钱还不够多
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.62,0:28:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够把你叫醒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.13,0:28:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.00,0:28:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是笑话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.51,0:28:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯老兄，你的样子就像我这么逊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙，等什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等人送饭吗？又是全新的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.69,0:28:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆战队的日子就像农场物语
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.27,0:28:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃得好，赚得多，还能大干一场
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱死陆战队 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.11,0:29:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,地板冰死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.07,0:29:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎样？帮你拿拖鞋？- 可以吗？那最好
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.54,0:29:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我，集合了，大伙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.87,0:29:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这差事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.30,0:29:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，威伯斯基，快起来，你的腿抽筋了？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.05,0:29:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,干完这活就有三周休假，法斯，你要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.01,0:29:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要呼吸顺畅，不是睡在冰冷的盒子里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.47,0:29:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,头儿，这样如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.67,0:29:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到十五区开会，过去集合
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.09,0:29:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,米拉，白雪公主是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就是女顾问
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.35,0:29:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然，她曾经见过异形
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.69,0:29:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有一套，我真佩服她
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.19,0:29:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳，你被误认成男人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.41,0:29:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.53,0:30:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳，你真是太悍了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.22,0:30:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大，什么任务？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.84,0:30:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,救援行动，你会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.05,0:30:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要解救殖民地，移民女儿的贞操
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.85,0:30:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,移民笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.61,0:30:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么烂东西？- 娃丝佳
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉米饼吧，对你有好处，吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.53,0:30:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意再找一些肉蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.62,0:30:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得吗？- 对呀，你那只是公的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.83,0:30:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当是肉蛋没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.54,0:30:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主教，表演一下吧 - 饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.08,0:30:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀，来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.63,0:30:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不要看 - 来啊，好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.30,0:30:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？老兄，你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.39,0:31:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别搞我，垂克 - 哈德森，闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.60,0:31:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 主教，老兄 - 动手，主教
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.27,0:31:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不要 - 别动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.94,0:31:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.95,0:31:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.46,0:31:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮冬瓜，吃你的晚餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.54,0:31:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.44,0:31:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈曼中尉？巴克先生？- 好，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,新任中尉不肯跟我们同桌吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,落水狗上岸，抖起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.90,0:31:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你从不会失手，主教
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.90,0:31:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说船上有生化人？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.78,0:32:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.91,0:32:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很平常，船上一向都有生化人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.08,0:32:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢被称为「人造人」
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.62,0:32:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.59,0:32:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有问题吗？- 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.34,0:32:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.34,0:32:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉上次因生化人造人故障
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.84,0:32:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 故障 - 发生问题，有些人被害死
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.81,0:32:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是想不到，旧的那一型吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.10,0:32:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,120-A2型
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.85,0:32:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就难怪，A2型常常有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们这些新生代不会有这种情形
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.32,0:32:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对不会伤害人类
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.99,0:32:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不要？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.29,0:32:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,离我远点，主教，明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.67,0:32:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜她也不喜欢玉米饼
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.35,0:33:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 部队立正，长官驾临 - 稍息
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！站好！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.48,0:33:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！听好！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安，陆战队员，很抱歉离开基地前没时间说明
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.74,0:33:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 什么事？希克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.28,0:33:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哈德森，长官，他才是希克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.45,0:33:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.46,0:33:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场战斗还是除虫行动？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.34,0:33:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前只知道还没和移民联络上…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.51,0:33:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一种异形侵入
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.47,0:33:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉，什么？- 异形
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.26,0:33:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是除虫行动
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.60,0:33:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 敌人到底是谁？- 蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.39,0:33:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把经过说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们降落在LV426
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.40,0:34:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,队员把附在脸上的东西带回去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.49,0:34:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,类似寄生虫的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.07,0:34:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试着弄下来，可是没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.49,0:34:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来好像脱皮而死
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.49,0:34:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯恩的气色不错
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.12,0:34:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起用晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.33,0:34:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定在他体内产卵
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.59,0:34:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后他就开始… - 听着，大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.63,0:34:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想知道它在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.80,0:34:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干掉它 - 随时随地
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.64,0:34:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人一提到异形，她就以为是非法移民
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.60,0:34:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去你的 - 随时奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.65,0:34:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.45,0:34:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你说的对，真的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.41,0:34:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，谢谢你，蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.54,0:34:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁碟片上也有蕾普莉的报告，我建议你们研究一下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.58,0:35:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只异形在24小时内消灭我全船人员
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果移民发现那艘船，不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.38,0:35:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少只已经在活动
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.13,0:35:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.31,0:35:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都在磁碟片上，最好去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.64,0:35:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.39,0:35:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？二等兵
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.86,0:35:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么脱离这胆小部队？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.94,0:35:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴，哈德森
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.36,0:35:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.53,0:35:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在听好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.74,0:35:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大家按规矩…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.95,0:35:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好地干
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.58,0:35:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上八点半携带战略资料
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.13,0:35:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,全副武装，全体动员…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.22,0:35:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离行动时间有七小时 - 又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.68,0:35:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手吧，各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.93,0:35:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，甜心们，你们听到中尉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.72,0:35:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快行动，哈德森，过来，给我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.16,0:36:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管，哈德森，快去做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.24,0:36:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,士官长，抽雪茄会得口腔癌
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.91,0:36:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,下士，我要这舱口关闭，快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.17,0:36:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多少没弄好，史都麦？- 最后一个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.67,0:36:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.15,0:36:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心后面
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.41,0:36:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查过3区吗？我来看看
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.12,0:36:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在游手好闲，可以帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.12,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，你能做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.46,0:37:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能操作起重机械人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.79,0:37:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有2等级数
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.55,0:37:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.18,0:37:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.18,0:38:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,请放到12区
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.99,0:39:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，甜心们，你们是一队，没什么好担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们前来是要奋力杀敌
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.17,0:39:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗？这就是我们的任务 - 明白
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.13,0:39:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们就这么干，大家好好表现
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，到预备位置！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.43,0:39:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们狠吗？够狠吗？- 是！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.30,0:39:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们是什么？- 陆战队！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森！到预备位置！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.89,0:39:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,动身了！到预备位置！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.94,0:39:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！快！妈的！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.94,0:39:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来！1、2、3！走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.61,0:39:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！走！走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.91,0:39:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一群悍将
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.62,0:39:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车了，进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.12,0:39:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.21,0:39:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车！上车！1、2、3
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.96,0:39:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,4、5、6人！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.39,0:39:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，战斗位置，大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.95,0:40:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器放好，快
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.33,0:40:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.75,0:40:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁好，哈德森
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,上路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.42,0:40:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.17,0:40:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.13,0:40:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了，哥儿们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.97,0:40:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备大干一场！走！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.60,0:40:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备，锁门，闸门关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.86,0:40:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,主连结器脱离，开启主动力
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.42,0:40:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 - 确认锁紧及发射安全
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.21,0:40:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定发射安全
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.01,0:41:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备，十秒钟
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.18,0:41:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我的口令，准备发射
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.31,0:41:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 5…4…3… - 我们正在下地狱，下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.07,0:41:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,2…1…发射
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.84,0:41:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转到DCS地形图 - 表面纵剖面图240度
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.30,0:41:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上5X5航道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.73,0:41:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,正通过电离层
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.98,0:41:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面有乱流
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.52,0:41:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,正冲过去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.42,0:42:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉，你有几次飞行经验？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.09,0:42:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,38次
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.59,0:42:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,模拟飞行
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.63,0:42:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,几次战斗经验？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.84,0:42:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次，包括这次
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.97,0:42:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 惨了 - 天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.99,0:42:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,014度，准备降落
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.08,0:42:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你，我有个坏预兆
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.04,0:42:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老是这么说：「我有个坏预兆」
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.55,0:43:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，万一你回不去
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.09,0:43:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会通知你父母
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.35,0:43:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.56,0:43:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在，精神很好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.85,0:43:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,垂克，你的电眼好像故障
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.53,0:43:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了，移动一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.90,0:43:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 准备好了，你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.11,0:43:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是最强战士 - 是的，没错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.28,0:43:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 铁血悍将，最好别惹我 - 谁是这里的头儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.79,0:43:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.88,0:43:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.71,0:43:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我的兄弟会保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.93,0:43:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！没错
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.93,0:43:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.18,0:43:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是独立瞄准粒子枪系统
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.81,0:43:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,包准把异形烧成焦炭
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.52,0:43:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有导弹系统
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.98,0:44:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最先进的太空武器
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.48,0:44:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有超音波电子枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.03,0:44:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有核子武器，还有刀具，很锋利
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.45,0:44:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了，韩森，大家准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.45,0:44:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,2分钟，各位准备行动
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.33,0:44:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,把西克斯叫醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.55,0:44:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,接近709度
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.10,0:44:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 自动导航锁定 - 该死的信号在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.06,0:44:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.74,0:44:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就是大气处理机？- 没错，就是它
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.11,0:44:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶尖的科技，全自动化
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.49,0:44:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也生产这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.67,0:45:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，弗洛，带我们到殖民地的主要区域
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.59,0:45:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,雨窗关闭
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.76,0:45:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有可见活动，好，稳住40英里前进
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.67,0:45:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道 - 慢慢绕着建筑物飞
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.49,0:45:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,结构似乎完整，他们仍有电力
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.91,0:45:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，弗洛，降落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.20,0:45:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,清除视觉障碍，随时待命
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.14,0:45:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以发动
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.64,0:45:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒钟，提起精神
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.85,0:46:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们来个漂亮分散队形
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.86,0:46:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.03,0:46:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.93,0:46:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一队就位，希克斯，你殿后
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.22,0:46:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳带头，前进！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.23,0:46:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.07,0:46:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森，把电门弄开
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.58,0:47:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二队前进，掩护队形
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.58,0:47:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二队就位
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.32,0:47:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了没？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.45,0:47:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.89,0:48:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二队往里面走，希克斯，搜上面的通道
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.84,0:48:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，你看到吗？看来是被轻型武器攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.93,0:48:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是地震引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.10,0:48:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸损害
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到吗？跟紧点
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.49,0:49:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯，哈德森，用你们的行动追踪器
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.27,0:49:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么迹象都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.92,0:49:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人一组搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.79,0:49:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪特里希，法斯，你们上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.92,0:50:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.14,0:50:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.26,0:50:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好，哈德森！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.94,0:51:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，里面没有可疑情况，我们继续搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.12,0:51:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，叫他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.09,0:51:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯，后退，镜头移向右边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.97,0:51:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看这里 - 看得到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.64,0:51:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是被腐蚀过，看来是杀死蕾普莉队员的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.27,0:51:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,硫酸血？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.31,0:51:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢那个，更会爱死这个
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.08,0:51:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.87,0:51:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二队，情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.71,0:51:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚检查完，没有人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.92,0:52:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 知道了 - 长官，这是死城
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.59,0:52:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事，我们都错过
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.30,0:52:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方安全，去看看电脑，有什么好看的？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.39,0:52:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下，还不安全 - 安全了，蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.31,0:52:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一队，向主控室前进
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.22,0:52:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈德森，接上他们的CUP - 遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.56,0:52:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希克斯，在南门等我，我来了 - 收到
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.11,0:52:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要进来，我觉得好安全
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.49,0:52:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来烦我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.59,0:52:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经和GCU连线了，没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.64,0:52:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备行动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.35,0:52:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.75,0:53:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.62,0:53:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.89,0:53:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，他们封锁区域的两端
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.98,0:53:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,舱门封住，楼梯被重物塞着
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.32,0:53:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来阻碍物好像没作用
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.45,0:53:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有尸体吗？- 没有，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.66,0:53:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一站
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.66,0:53:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来打过一场大战
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.20,0:53:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，好像是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.75,0:54:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，垂克，这边
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.96,0:54:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能从化验室到主控室
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.76,0:55:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.52,0:55:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈曼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.41,0:55:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说的一样吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.34,0:55:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点，巴克
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.98,0:55:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来它对你一见钟情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.98,0:55:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它喜欢你，巴克
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.40,0:55:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个还活着，其余死了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.91,0:56:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「进行割除异体胚胎时
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.95,0:56:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰死于手术中「
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.75,0:56:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了他，取走异形
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.25,0:56:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.51,0:56:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看有动静了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.80,0:56:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在我们后面 - 我们的人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.06,0:56:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿朋，你的人都在吗？有人在D区吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.64,0:56:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，我们都在主控室
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.48,0:56:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回答，法斯
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.61,0:56:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.01,0:56:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在动了 - 哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.05,0:57:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝着我们来 一直来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.13,0:57:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可恶 - 慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.68,0:57:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.70,0:58:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.91,0:58:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事了 - 捉住她，下士
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.25,0:58:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕，过来，我们不会害你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.42,0:58:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.79,0:58:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来！出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.05,0:58:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢慢来 - 我捉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.21,0:58:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.22,0:58:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别跟丢了！- 她在管子下面，别让她跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.09,0:58:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把灯照过来 - 她跑到哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.31,0:58:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开灯！- 这里！这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.23,0:58:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里！这里！她在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.02,0:58:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！退后！别吓到她！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.73,0:58:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 捉住她，她会跑掉 - 可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.70,0:58:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.66,0:58:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.48,0:59:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！没事了！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.44,0:59:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.32,0:59:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.49,0:59:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！不！不可以！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.49,0:59:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的 - 你会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.04,0:59:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.20,0:59:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点！慢点！你会没事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.46,0:59:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.05,0:59:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！嘘！嘘！
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.17,0:59:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点！慢点！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.25,1:00:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她叫什么名字？- 丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.84,1:00:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回想一下，丽贝卡，专心想
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.88,1:00:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头开始想
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.80,1:00:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父母在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.93,1:00:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，丽贝卡，你必须…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.23,1:00:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈曼，让她休息吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.19,1:00:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,头壳坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的身体很好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.03,1:00:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是营养不良，不会有大碍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.32,1:00:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，我们在浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.29,1:01:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝这个
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.71,1:01:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,热巧克力
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.55,1:01:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.05,1:01:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.35,1:01:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.69,1:01:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你擦一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.23,1:01:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，看来我得擦干净
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.58,1:01:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难想像这里还有个小女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.12,1:01:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.34,1:01:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢讲话，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.93,1:02:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸烟区，还是非吸烟区？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.98,1:02:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我你在扫瞄什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.98,1:02:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- PDTS - 什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.98,1:02:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,私人资料转换器
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.98,1:02:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个移民都有植入
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.61,1:02:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十公里内可以测到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.86,1:02:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但目前为止，什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.12,1:02:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎么活下来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.12,1:02:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你很勇敢，丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.50,1:02:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.46,1:02:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.05,1:02:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.34,1:02:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了我哥哥，没人叫我丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.56,1:02:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，好名字
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.52,1:02:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蕾普莉，很高兴认识你
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.32,1:02:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.53,1:02:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯西 - 哈罗，凯西
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.32,1:02:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥呢？他叫什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.37,1:02:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂米
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.49,1:03:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂米也在吗？也许跟你一样藏起来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.00,1:03:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有姐妹吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.59,1:03:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸妈呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.35,1:03:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，看着我，他们在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.68,1:03:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了，我可以走吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.86,1:03:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾，纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们在一起比较安全
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.87,1:03:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人会保护你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.99,1:03:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是军人
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.04,1:03:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也没有用
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.34,1:03:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.93,1:04:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，你还要什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.77,1:04:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.90,1:04:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的宠物很可爱，主教
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.11,1:04:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.11,1:04:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管别的事，我找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.24,1:04:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还活着吗？- 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.87,1:04:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来到处都是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.87,1:04:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在加工厂，地下三楼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.13,1:04:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,主冷冻库也有
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.80,1:04:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来它们在那里集合
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.51,1:04:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,整装出发，阿朋
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.51,1:04:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.89,1:04:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发了，军机不得延误
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.56,1:04:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们大干一场！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.60,1:04:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，法斯，你开车
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.41,1:05:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的，别担心 一切都没事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.41,1:05:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇暴队形，第二队左翼
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.50,1:05:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,方位664前进，镜头打开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.62,1:05:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,队形前进包围RF
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.84,1:05:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森，打开镜头，左，右，各位
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.17,1:06:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十米，方位221，应该有楼梯
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.43,1:06:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.85,1:06:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,目的地，地下三楼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.98,1:06:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，各位，哈德森，你开路
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.31,1:06:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯，你殿后
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.77,1:06:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来，检查角落
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.03,1:06:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查角落
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.66,1:06:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保持距离 - 听到没有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.37,1:06:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱走
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.37,1:06:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄影机有点视讯不良
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.21,1:06:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能受到建筑物干扰
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.80,1:06:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,用灯照
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.71,1:06:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个来了，向216区前进
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.18,1:06:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，216区
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.56,1:06:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不到是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.64,1:06:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢？我只负责砍怪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.70,1:07:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.87,1:07:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.79,1:07:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.89,1:07:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到敌人再打
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.85,1:07:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我们在找移民
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.99,1:07:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.99,1:07:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧点，法斯，你快脱队了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.25,1:07:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.84,1:08:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是树脂分泌物
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.84,1:08:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，从哪儿来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.72,1:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别碰
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.47,1:08:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怪物还真有一套
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.51,1:08:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真的很热
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.85,1:08:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，不过这是闷热
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.85,1:08:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹了，哈德森
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.74,1:08:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉，这些电波枪火力如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.16,1:08:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,10公分口径高爆弹
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.62,1:08:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准化轻武器
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.77,1:08:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 看看你的队员所在地
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.11,1:08:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在主电源室下面
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.44,1:08:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.53,1:08:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发射火力会波及冷却系统
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.32,1:08:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她说的一点都没错 - 又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.66,1:08:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地理论上是座核子反应炉
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.96,1:08:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.42,1:09:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说的是热核子爆炸，一开火就完了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.17,1:09:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.88,1:09:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.64,1:09:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，阿朋
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.81,1:09:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不能在里头开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.32,1:09:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命令你把所有弹匣收起来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.15,1:09:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯啦？- 我们要用什么，用粗话骂？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.28,1:09:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只准用喷火枪，不准用机枪 - 长官，我…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.20,1:09:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，手榴弹也不行
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.87,1:09:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，你们听到了，拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.96,1:09:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，娃丝佳，快点
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.55,1:09:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.93,1:09:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样，威伯斯基，拿来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.14,1:09:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,克罗，我现在就要，拿来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.18,1:09:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好，娃丝佳
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆战队员，全都拿来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.40,1:09:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,法斯，你负责，打开袋子
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:10:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢了，士官长 - 希克斯，掩护我后面
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.57,1:10:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前走
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.57,1:10:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要这个作埋身肉博
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.24,1:10:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.09,1:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.09,1:10:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.48,1:10:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.70,1:10:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，坐到前面
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.29,1:10:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,去啊，快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.44,1:11:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来，我们要完成行动
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.28,1:11:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们陆战队要开工了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.78,1:11:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 继续行动 - 小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.49,1:12:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命啊 - 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.20,1:12:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边有个活的 - 你不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.03,1:12:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，杀了我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.29,1:12:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点，我会救你的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.25,1:12:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事，帮我一下，我们得救她出来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.92,1:12:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？迪特里希 - 她抽筋了！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.38,1:12:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪特里希，退后！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.13,1:12:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.64,1:12:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！- 法斯，发射喷火枪，杀了它！
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.02,1:12:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 退后 - 发射喷火枪，快！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.47,1:13:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静了！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.26,1:13:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个方向？- 我无法锁定！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.10,1:13:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样？哈德森
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.56,1:13:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,讯号繁复
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.81,1:13:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们接近中
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.02,1:13:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,用红外线镜，小心点！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.40,1:13:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？什么也看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.82,1:13:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把部队撤回来，戈曼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.58,1:13:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有讯号了，前面，后面
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.42,1:13:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里？我怎么看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.71,1:13:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对，这里没有东西
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.30,1:13:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的，有东西，不是我们！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.80,1:13:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他妈的 - 已经超出追踪器的容量了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.89,1:14:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是，天哪！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.26,1:14:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能用红外线看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.44,1:14:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,法斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.03,1:14:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.46,1:14:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，阿朋，发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.13,1:14:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,威伯斯基和克罗受伤！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.17,1:14:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪特里希，克罗 - 关掉声音！法斯！迪特里希！法斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.60,1:14:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,法斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.51,1:14:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,威伯斯基？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.14,1:14:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,威伯斯基？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.98,1:14:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.36,1:14:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在开火？该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.32,1:15:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我命令停火 - 它们从墙上钻出来！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.45,1:15:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们从墙上钻出来！完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.91,1:15:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意右边 - 阿朋
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.21,1:15:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们停火
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.04,1:15:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳，垂克，停火！该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.88,1:15:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿朋，听到没有？停火…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.88,1:15:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开焚化炉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.51,1:15:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,重覆，全部退到焚化炉后
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.97,1:15:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们停火，退到…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.77,1:15:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,焚化炉后，完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.23,1:15:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.23,1:15:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中士！- 阿朋
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.74,1:15:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说话，阿朋，收到！收到！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.24,1:15:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快说话，阿朋 - 他死了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 叫他们回来 - 住嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.70,1:15:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点，活着的人全都撤退 - 闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.71,1:15:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴！该死的！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.71,1:15:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们从墙上钻出来！阿朋在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.21,1:15:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,士官长死了，我们赶快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.59,1:16:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走！- 快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.47,1:16:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森！娃丝佳？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.68,1:16:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森！小心！打死它！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.89,1:16:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.98,1:16:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希克斯 - 在你身后，撤退！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.48,1:16:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫他们撤退 - 撤退！妈的！立刻！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.07,1:16:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们被切断！- 哈德森！快跑路！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.07,1:16:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想想办法！- 撤退！陆战队！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.03,1:16:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.12,1:16:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快撤退！- 坐好！纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.87,1:16:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.05,1:16:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我回去！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.14,1:16:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.02,1:16:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈的！别碰我！- 见鬼，这是命令！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.56,1:16:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没机会了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.62,1:17:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.10,1:17:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.81,1:17:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！走！快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.23,1:17:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,此路不通，我们得绕道！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.78,1:17:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去开门，希克斯 - 垂克，我们要走了！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.66,1:17:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些王八蛋！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.53,1:17:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.20,1:17:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.42,1:17:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走吧！- 加把劲！加把劲！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.76,1:18:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,垂克！快来呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.18,1:18:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.48,1:18:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 车上起火 - 他没救了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.40,1:18:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去灭火
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.36,1:18:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快去灭火！- 垂克 快来！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.20,1:18:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他没救了！- 垂克！不！他没有…！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.58,1:18:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了！他死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.38,1:18:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关门！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.72,1:18:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃子弹吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.68,1:18:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！走！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.79,1:19:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了！我们脱身了！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.79,1:20:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，你弄坏了轮胎！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.29,1:20:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就个金属轮子在滚！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.29,1:20:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放慢！放慢！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.59,1:20:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,放慢！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.71,1:20:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,放慢！放慢！放慢！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.15,1:20:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.77,1:20:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.90,1:20:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要你管
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.07,1:20:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉，戈曼如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.16,1:20:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，也许撞到了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.49,1:20:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还活着 - 他死定了！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.87,1:20:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒，我要宰了你！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.04,1:20:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.71,1:20:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我急救箱
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.97,1:20:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，看
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.18,1:20:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,士官长和迪特里希没死
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.56,1:20:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,讯号很弱，不过还没死
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.64,1:21:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们回去救人 - 去你的！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.02,1:21:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不会留下战友 - 我才不回去
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.48,1:21:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也没办法！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.02,1:21:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有救了，他们会像其他人一样变成卵状
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.99,1:21:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天，不会吧 - 见鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.33,1:21:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能！不可能！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.50,1:21:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有七支CN20散弹炮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.13,1:21:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用摧泪弹打它们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.55,1:21:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一试，不过根本不知道有没有效
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.42,1:21:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧，算平手好了 - 还说这些干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.97,1:21:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好从空中用核弹炸掉这地方
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.56,1:21:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.56,1:21:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真有一套 - 慢点！慢点！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.90,1:21:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很有价值的巨资工程
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.15,1:21:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫公司寄帐单给我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.74,1:22:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点，大家都很激动
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.87,1:22:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道，但我们不要开玩笑，拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.37,1:22:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们面对的是很重要的生物
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.42,1:22:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为你们有权…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.25,1:22:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 任意杀光它 - 错了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.42,1:22:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.05,1:22:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你瞎了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.43,1:22:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点没命！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.18,1:22:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是瞎子
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.60,1:22:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不同意这行动
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.27,1:22:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.48,1:22:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信希克斯下士…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.48,1:22:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有指挥权
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.95,1:22:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯下士
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.95,1:22:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是项军事行动
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.41,1:22:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯有第二指挥权
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.41,1:22:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗？下士
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.66,1:22:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.79,1:22:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.42,1:22:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.55,1:22:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很昂贵的工程
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.09,1:22:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能乱下命令
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.09,1:22:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是小兵，别介意
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.76,1:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没关系，弗洛，你听到吗？- 准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.60,1:23:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上撤退
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.35,1:23:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，立即出发
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.35,1:23:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说起飞后用核弹炸掉这地方，这是唯一的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.61,1:23:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.45,1:23:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，抬起来，哈德森，抬起来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.21,1:23:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，把他放下来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.97,1:23:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，史巴梅尔，起飞了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.19,1:23:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点，有东西…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.19,1:23:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,少罗唆，快上来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.57,1:23:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进来了，挡板关起来
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.80,1:24:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,史巴梅尔
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.97,1:24:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.72,1:24:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.82,1:24:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.61,1:25:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了，这下全完了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.49,1:25:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.03,1:25:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在可惨了！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.41,1:25:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好了没有？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.62,1:25:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.80,1:25:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没办法走了，对不对？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.09,1:25:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.80,1:25:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必道歉，这不是你的错
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.81,1:25:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了，什么都完了！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.27,1:25:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.98,1:26:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以生个火，唱唱歌，这样好不好？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.48,1:26:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天黑前得回去
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.32,1:26:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们都在夜间活动，多半都是
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.51,1:26:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都在这儿吗？好的，这些都是…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.60,1:26:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,失事船上能用的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.68,1:26:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,四把50连发电波散弹枪
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.35,1:26:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不太理想
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.56,1:26:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有15个M40手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.36,1:26:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.40,1:26:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 危险，甜心 - 那是唯一的喷火枪吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.95,1:26:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，燃料只剩一半，还能用
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.08,1:26:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个坏了，我不大清楚这支
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.91,1:26:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是我们有四套这种机械感应器
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.79,1:27:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且大致都相当完好
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.92,1:27:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要消灭异形的话，这些应该派得上用场
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.17,1:27:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没按时回航，几时才有救援？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.64,1:27:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,17天
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.77,1:27:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,17天？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.40,1:27:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄，我不想扫兴，我们连17小时都撑不了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.36,1:27:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪物不会放过我们，他们会…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.11,1:27:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈德森！哈德森！- 他们会追过来把我们都干掉！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.28,1:27:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小女孩没有武器…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.41,1:27:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没受过军事训练，都活到现在
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.54,1:27:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.83,1:27:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她指挥呀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.03,1:27:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好要振作点，哈德森，听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.55,1:27:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森，我们需要你
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.80,1:27:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别罗唆
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.80,1:27:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,用电脑找出楼层平面图
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.47,1:27:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗？建筑蓝图
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.27,1:27:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方的布局平面图，你在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.73,1:28:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有 - 我要通风口
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.90,1:28:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小通道，地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.36,1:28:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何能逃出这里的资料
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.15,1:28:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间不多 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.74,1:28:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好，我去找 - 哈德森！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.12,1:28:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.21,1:28:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到化验室看戈曼，继续研究
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.34,1:28:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，这样最好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.47,1:28:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定是走这条通道
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.39,1:28:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，它们从处理室…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.98,1:28:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到地下室
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.36,1:28:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来一点，好，再过来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.78,1:28:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去，好，定点就是这里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.66,1:29:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，回去 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.25,1:29:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有个压力舱
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.00,1:29:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它关闭可以阻挡一阵子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.72,1:29:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确有用，但它们可能从别处进来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.80,1:29:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，所以我们要在这些交叉点放置阻碍物
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.93,1:29:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，再把通道封死…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.69,1:29:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里和这里
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.15,1:29:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样他们就只能通过2条走廊过来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.24,1:29:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止它到化验室及主控室
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.03,1:29:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 了不起
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.58,1:29:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可以放心玩牌了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.83,1:29:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，大伙，照计划进行
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.04,1:29:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遵命！- 遵命！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.06,1:30:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们封闭这通道，宝贝，快点，搞完走人
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.81,1:30:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是哈德森，A和B感应器已经全部装好了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.77,1:30:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待命，我们已经在准备武装了 - 可以了，哈德森
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.74,1:30:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手！开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.37,1:30:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶快离开这里吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.25,1:30:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要封锁这个区域，快点
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.89,1:30:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，希望有用
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.77,1:30:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你戴上这个
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.44,1:30:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 做什么？- 定位器
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.77,1:30:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以在任何地方找到你
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.07,1:30:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是为安全起见 - 谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.24,1:31:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不表示我们订婚了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.12,1:31:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.73,1:31:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.78,1:31:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,上床
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.78,1:31:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,脚放进去，这才乖
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.95,1:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿睡一下，你累坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.08,1:31:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不睡，我会做恶梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.84,1:31:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌凯西不会做恶梦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.01,1:31:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一看
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.01,1:32:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，没有什么
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.43,1:32:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，你可以跟她一样
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.81,1:32:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，她是不会做恶梦的…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.39,1:32:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她只是布偶
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.52,1:32:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，抱歉，纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.74,1:32:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.08,1:32:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈常说这里没有怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.04,1:32:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有真的怪物，可是真的有
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.71,1:32:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.75,1:32:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么这么说？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.97,1:32:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数时候他们都是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.97,1:32:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会不会被怪兽攻击？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.51,1:32:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.39,1:32:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.44,1:32:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的小孩，不就是这样来的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.15,1:32:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也是体内孕育的 - 不，两者有很大的不同
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.78,1:33:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有生过小孩？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.78,1:33:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有，我有一个小女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.20,1:33:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她现在在哪里？- 她走了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.58,1:33:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说她死了？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.13,1:33:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这给你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.46,1:33:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，戴上它
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.80,1:33:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,保平安用
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.97,1:33:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.10,1:33:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走！拜托！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.10,1:33:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在隔壁
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.73,1:33:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到墙上的电眼吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.73,1:33:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从那里随时看到
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.61,1:33:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是安全
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.33,1:33:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你，纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.08,1:33:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的，我保证
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.08,1:33:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.83,1:33:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.21,1:34:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死都不会？- 死都不会
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.40,1:34:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡吧，不要做梦
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.03,1:34:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.75,1:34:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物死后酸血层氧化就没危险
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.09,1:34:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，很有意思，不过我没兴趣
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.59,1:34:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底在对抗什么东西？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.22,1:34:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新想想
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.39,1:34:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们捉住移民，送到这里…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.68,1:34:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为宿主，再繁殖更多怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.10,1:35:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表示有更多异形，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.02,1:35:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算一个宿主对应一个异形，至少超过一百只
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.28,1:35:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，没错
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.28,1:35:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个异形都是卵生的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.87,1:35:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把蛋藏起来呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.87,1:35:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.04,1:35:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是我们还没见过的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.08,1:35:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就像蚂蚁窝
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.38,1:35:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说蜂窝吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.50,1:35:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我的意思，它就像是女王蜂一样掌控全局
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.76,1:35:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错，就是女王蜂 - 没错，就是它
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.22,1:35:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很难缠
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.68,1:35:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西可不像蚂蚁，我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.31,1:35:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，我要你把标本销毁
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.06,1:35:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懂吗？- 巴克先生下达指令…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.07,1:35:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我带活标本回基地
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.25,1:35:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他特别交待的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.63,1:35:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些标本价值非凡
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.72,1:36:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你够聪明，咱们会成为英雄
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.18,1:36:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,下半辈子都不愁吃穿
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.44,1:36:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了，巴克，你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.11,1:36:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种危险生物能通过检疫吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.36,1:36:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人了解它们，怎么通不过？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.32,1:36:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.45,1:36:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也会知道，你害死157个移民
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.79,1:36:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 你派他们来这里
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.33,1:36:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你弄错了 - 我查过移民日志
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.50,1:36:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发日期61279，巴克卡特签署
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.46,1:36:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派他们来，却没警告他们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.51,1:36:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为何不警告他们？- 听着
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.01,1:36:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过那鬼船也许不存在吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.60,1:36:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不知道，要是我小题大做
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.39,1:36:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个单位都来干涉，公司得不到专利权
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.85,1:36:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都吃亏，我犯了错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.98,1:36:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是判断错误，蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.82,1:36:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 判断错误？- 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.57,1:36:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人都死了！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.28,1:36:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你干了什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.78,1:37:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要让他们逮到你送进监狱！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.79,1:37:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想夹着尾巴跑掉
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.12,1:37:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要整垮你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.13,1:37:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.25,1:37:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来对你很有信心
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.34,1:37:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是聪明人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.38,1:37:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴让你失望
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.36,1:37:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 它们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.86,1:37:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？- 在隧道里
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.87,1:37:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的武器已经追踪到它们并开火，目标有好多个
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.01,1:37:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些武器还真行
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.55,1:37:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,B枪弹药已经用掉一半了…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.85,1:38:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面一定战况激烈
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.06,1:38:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,B枪只剩下60发子弹了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.90,1:38:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,40发、20发、10发！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.15,1:38:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,B枪弹药已经用完了，A枪只剩下20发
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.65,1:38:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,10发、5发！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.74,1:38:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,用完了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.50,1:38:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊，下面真是一场混战
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.71,1:38:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在撞门
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.30,1:38:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.34,1:38:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是主教，有坏消息
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.10,1:38:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒新鲜
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.18,1:38:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮，主教，有什么问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.06,1:38:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个紧急通风口
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.69,1:38:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好，真是智者千虑必有一失
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.44,1:38:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多久喷一次？- 4小时
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.40,1:39:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围大概30公里半径
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.53,1:39:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,平均4千万吨
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.29,1:39:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 难题来了 - 我不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.83,1:39:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳，把窗闸关起来
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.42,1:39:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不从这里关闭？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.67,1:39:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，坠机造成严重损害
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.67,1:39:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有办法修复
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.30,1:39:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天，越来越没希望
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.30,1:39:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,只差4星期我便可以退役，我们被困死了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.76,1:39:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不公平 - 哈德森，少罗唆！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.89,1:39:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个礼拜，天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.56,1:39:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须派一艘船来救我们
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.86,1:39:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有办法摇控太空船
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.90,1:39:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做？联络系统坏了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.53,1:39:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样，我们最好想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.87,1:39:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想个屁，我们死定了 - 住嘴！
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.79,1:39:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴，殖民地的通讯器呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.66,1:39:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,终端在控制塔，我们可以利用吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.54,1:39:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，我查过，那里的通道被堵住
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.59,1:39:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法联接天线
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.59,1:39:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定得有人出去
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.09,1:40:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿电脑亲自去修复
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.09,1:40:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀，怪物就在附近徘徊，我可不去
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.27,1:40:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你哪儿都不敢去 - 我去
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.35,1:40:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，没错，你去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.27,1:40:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.19,1:40:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去，只有我有资格遥控太空船
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.61,1:40:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该让主教去 - 好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.07,1:40:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，我宁可不去
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.32,1:40:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我是人造人，我可不笨
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.01,1:40:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多远？
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.01,1:40:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,水管几乎一直通到上层大厅，180公尺
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.39,1:40:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爬到那儿要40分钟 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.76,1:40:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,联接天线大约要一个小时
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.60,1:40:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把太空船准备好要30分钟
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.98,1:40:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行时间约50分钟，时间紧迫
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.70,1:41:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝好运 - 回头见
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.87,1:41:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.86,1:41:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.84,1:41:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不敢相信已经逼近至20米处
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.56,1:41:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 15米处 - 多少只
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.73,1:41:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说，反正很多
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.90,1:41:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,D枪已经用了一半的子弹…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.19,1:41:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,C枪也差不多了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.28,1:41:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道没有办法阻止它们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.54,1:41:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- D枪只剩下150发了 - 挺住啊
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.62,1:41:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,100发
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.00,1:42:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！加油！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.51,1:42:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,B枪只剩下20发了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.26,1:42:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,10发
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.93,1:42:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.97,1:42:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，它们撤退了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.23,1:42:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的枪火阻止它们了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.82,1:42:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.16,1:42:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次就没这么多子弹了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.17,1:42:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过它们不知道这点
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.21,1:42:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们也许会从别的地方进来
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.00,1:42:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以解决它们的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.01,1:42:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许它们被我们逼得动弹不得 - 闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.84,1:42:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们在四处巡逻
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.89,1:42:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.69,1:43:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.98,1:43:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都快累死了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.99,1:43:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是要沉着机警点
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.70,1:43:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那怪物进来我们就完了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.66,1:43:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.72,1:43:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你多久没睡？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.80,1:43:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,24小时？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.51,1:43:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯，我不想像他们那样
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.89,1:43:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会「处理善后」吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.31,1:43:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那怪物进来，我会把我俩先杀了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.57,1:43:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好，希望不会那样
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.40,1:43:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？- 好的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.08,1:44:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你介绍一个好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.37,1:44:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是M41A电波机关枪，10厘米口径
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.38,1:44:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,上下都有30厘米手榴弹筒
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.30,1:44:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试重量
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.18,1:44:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我该怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.90,1:44:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓紧 - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.65,1:44:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,夹紧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.03,1:44:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有后座力
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.78,1:44:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当指数变零时
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.45,1:44:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 按这个？- 对
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.79,1:44:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快换弹匣，用力卡住
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.04,1:44:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能大干了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.17,1:44:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 手榴弹筒
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.65,1:44:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好别碰
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.88,1:44:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你开的头，全教我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.97,1:44:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能自己来
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.52,1:45:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.61,1:45:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.65,1:45:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好吧！好像大醉一场
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.70,1:45:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉，我只想… - 算了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.00,1:45:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.97,1:46:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘！嘘！嘘！没事了！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.00,1:46:57.75,Note,0,0,0,0,,（启动）
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.46,1:47:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，醒醒！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.96,1:47:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出声
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.97,1:47:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遇上麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.49,1:48:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.36,1:48:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.51,1:48:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.44,1:48:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.86,1:48:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希克斯！- 来人！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.90,1:48:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，再说一次
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.91,1:48:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接通自动加油的程式，频率没错？
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.37,1:48:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，继续联络
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.50,1:48:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你发动引擎再联络
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.12,1:48:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 他在上层塔台
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.50,1:49:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.71,1:49:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希克斯！希克斯！- 救命！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.80,1:49:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命！救命！- 希克斯！救命呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.47,1:49:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把玻璃弄破！弄破呀！弄破！- 聪明！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.64,1:49:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试试看
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.91,1:49:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉，我好怕
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.46,1:49:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.92,1:49:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.73,1:50:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是医疗化验室，哈德森！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.86,1:50:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳，到化验室会合，有火灾
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.28,1:50:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上来
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.16,1:50:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.73,1:50:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,射玻璃！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.82,1:50:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈德森 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.29,1:50:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子！当心！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.55,1:51:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.43,1:51:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边，好了吗？- 好了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.73,1:51:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.86,1:51:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈德森 - 安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.86,1:51:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一只也死了，完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.82,1:51:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.91,1:51:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巴克，是巴克搞的鬼
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.75,1:51:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就宰了这混帐
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.04,1:51:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点道理也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.93,1:51:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以为能偷运一只异形，通过检疫站…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.05,1:51:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们之中有人能…孕育它
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.06,1:52:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么说
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.35,1:52:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把尸体冷冻运回去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.02,1:52:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道我们带着怪物回去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.15,1:52:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.03,1:52:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，我们不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.07,1:52:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只要…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.41,1:52:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在回航途中破坏我们的冷冻库…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.25,1:52:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,名义上，你们的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.92,1:52:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再把尸体丢掉，随便编什么故事
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.88,1:52:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他死定了 - 太岂有此理了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.26,1:52:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.26,1:52:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你在说什么话
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.97,1:52:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你幻想的
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.73,1:52:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真悲哀，真可怜
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.15,1:52:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克，我不知道谁比较坏
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.03,1:52:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会为了利益互相残杀
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.40,1:52:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我们宰了他
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.62,1:52:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他得回去
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.45,1:53:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它们把电力切断了 - 什么？它们切断电源？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.16,1:53:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能？他们是动物
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.83,1:53:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去查走廊，快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.50,1:53:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈曼，看着巴克 - 交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.50,1:53:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，靠紧点
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.30,1:53:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我走这边 - 去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.12,1:53:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有动静吗？- 那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.00,1:53:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在里面
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.29,1:53:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你测到的是我
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.25,1:53:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！不是你！
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.34,1:53:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在里面，它们在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.09,1:54:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森，冷静点，娃丝佳？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.31,1:54:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森可能说对了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:11.02,1:54:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们都回来 - 信号好怪
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.53,1:54:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是某种干扰
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.28,1:54:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都有讯号！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.28,1:54:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快回主控室 - 游戏开始
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.70,1:54:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.62,1:54:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门封起来！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.58,1:54:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！回来！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.13,1:54:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快点
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.43,1:54:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把眼睛遮起来，别看火焰
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.68,1:54:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动静，信号清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.77,1:54:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围，20米
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.77,1:54:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们找到进来的路，我们有漏洞
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.02,1:54:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有漏洞
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.02,1:54:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,18米…17米…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.90,1:54:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝图上没有的，我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.36,1:55:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 15米 - 蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.53,1:55:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对在障碍物内 - 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.66,1:55:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,13米，就在门外
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.66,1:55:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们退后，讯号真大
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.37,1:55:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 娃丝佳，你那里如何？快回答 - 快好了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.21,1:55:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.67,1:55:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,12米、11米
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.05,1:55:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 10米 - 他们要攻过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.64,1:55:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 9米 - 记住，快速开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.97,1:55:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,8米
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.31,1:55:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,7米
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.07,1:55:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 6米 - 在里面，不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.07,1:55:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上面这么显示 - 你看错了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.70,1:55:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 5米，天啊，4米 - 搞什么鬼？
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.96,1:55:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天，把灯给我
Dialogue: 0,1:56:13.14,1:56:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了，在那边，干掉它们
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.65,1:56:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！干掉它们！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.44,1:56:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快想办法！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.86,1:56:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉它们！还有好多！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.66,1:56:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到医药中心！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.87,1:56:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森！小心！小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.04,1:56:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.42,1:56:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:44.68,1:56:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.64,1:56:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克！快打开！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.52,1:56:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！撤退！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.40,1:56:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.69,1:57:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去死吧！混蛋！- 巴克！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.61,1:57:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森！哈德森！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.28,1:57:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八蛋！来！快点！过来！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.37,1:57:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时奉陪！来啊！来呀！混帐！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.12,1:57:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样，还要吗？你也想尝尝？
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.96,1:57:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.21,1:57:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的！希克斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.05,1:57:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈德森！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:34.81,1:57:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.81,1:57:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁住了！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.37,1:58:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了！走！- 走！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.71,1:58:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 戈曼！快点！- 封起来
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.63,1:58:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克！天杀的！开门！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.94,1:58:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.61,1:58:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点！- 戈曼！让开！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.99,1:58:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！这里！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.07,1:58:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，走在我后面
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.03,1:58:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你要干嘛！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.46,1:58:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯！走！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.96,1:58:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.43,1:58:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 降落场在哪边？- 这边
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.52,1:59:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.61,1:59:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边！这边！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.20,1:59:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪边？- 往前然后左转
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.75,1:59:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，听到吗？请回答
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.42,1:59:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,船快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.38,1:59:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,预定16分钟抵达
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.55,1:59:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好，我们要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.60,1:59:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在哪条路？- 那条
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.65,1:59:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不，这条 - 你确定吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.28,1:59:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳！快来！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.74,1:59:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在这上面 - 希克斯
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.99,1:59:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了！
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.95,2:00:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，等一下！纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.23,2:00:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,娃丝佳！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.27,2:00:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.74,2:00:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.50,2:00:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.92,2:00:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋顶有捷径
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.34,2:00:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.85,2:01:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,戈曼，你老是那么笨
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.37,2:01:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纽伊特！- 蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.67,2:01:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.00,2:01:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯！快去救她！快！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.59,2:01:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 纽伊特，抓住！- 我要滑下去了！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.14,2:01:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别松手！- 蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.43,2:01:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住了！- 救命！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.48,2:01:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住你！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.02,2:01:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.02,2:01:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.24,2:01:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用这个找她
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.16,2:02:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 待在那儿别动 - 蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.95,2:02:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就到了
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.26,2:02:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.72,2:02:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.02,2:02:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接近了 - 纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.02,2:02:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.02,2:02:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿？听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.86,2:02:37.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，这边！
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.86,2:02:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在这儿 - 哪里
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.12,2:02:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.25,2:02:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,得切断它
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.12,2:02:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下，我们得切断它
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.76,2:03:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特？
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.76,2:03:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动，要静静的
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.14,2:03:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.23,2:03:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了，你别动
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.07,2:03:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希克斯，快！- 我知道！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.95,2:03:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我是说真的！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:36.05,2:03:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特，你别动
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.18,2:03:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,快好了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.47,2:03:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.60,2:03:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.49,2:04:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.11,2:04:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！不！不！- 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,2:04:05.32,2:04:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会杀死你！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.62,2:04:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不会杀她
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.83,2:04:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着，她还活着！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.79,2:04:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我相信你，她还活着
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.29,2:04:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们得走了！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.85,2:04:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.97,2:04:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希克斯 - 脱下来
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.95,2:04:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,快脱掉！
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.50,2:05:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.60,2:05:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.06,2:05:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，你办得到
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.54,2:05:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，还有多少时间？
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.88,2:05:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多，26分钟
Dialogue: 0,2:05:43.80,2:05:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们还不走 - 是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.51,2:07:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉 - 别说了，主教，她还活着，还有时间
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.97,2:07:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过19分钟这星球会化成烟
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.23,2:07:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,希克斯，别让他跑了，我们那儿也不去
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.48,2:07:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们后会有期了，希克斯 - 杜恩
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.61,2:07:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫杜恩
Dialogue: 0,2:07:32.16,2:07:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫爱伦
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.16,2:07:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱伦，快去快回
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.92,2:07:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意，紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.09,2:07:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体撤离
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.22,2:07:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩15分钟…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.14,2:07:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃至安全地区
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.73,2:08:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意，紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.27,2:08:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体撤离
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.57,2:08:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩14分钟…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.41,2:08:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃至安全地区
Dialogue: 0,2:12:37.54,2:12:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蕾普莉！蕾普莉！- 纽伊特！
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.15,2:12:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧我！抓紧了！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.38,2:16:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧！
Dialogue: 0,2:16:55.34,2:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:48.61,2:17:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意！紧急情况！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:51.53,2:17:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体撤离
Dialogue: 0,2:17:56.32,2:17:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意！紧急情况！
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.53,2:18:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体撤离！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:04.12,2:18:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩4分钟…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:06.67,2:18:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃至安全地区
Dialogue: 0,2:18:25.10,2:18:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点呀！该死！
Dialogue: 0,2:18:32.56,2:18:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧我！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:23.91,2:19:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意！紧急情况！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.79,2:19:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体撤离！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.79,2:19:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩2分钟…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.54,2:19:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃至安全地区
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.26,2:19:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.56,2:19:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，你真该死！
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.25,2:20:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝，把眼睛闭上
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.88,2:21:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.76,2:21:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀！快呀！
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.25,2:21:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教！全速前进！
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.05,2:22:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了！安全了！
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.85,2:22:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.23,2:22:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了
Dialogue: 0,2:22:44.82,2:22:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会来
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.75,2:23:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会复原，他只是昏过去
Dialogue: 0,2:23:04.00,2:23:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他打了一针
Dialogue: 0,2:23:07.59,2:23:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要担架送他就医
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.26,2:23:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,2:23:17.93,2:23:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉把你吓坏，起落站不稳定
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.02,2:23:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只好绕飞希望别出问题
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.90,2:23:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教，你做的很好
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.95,2:23:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？- 是的
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.11,2:24:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,走！快走！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.74,2:24:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！这边！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.00,2:24:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,2:24:26.29,2:24:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边！
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.63,2:25:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远点，贱货！
Dialogue: 0,2:26:20.89,2:26:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！来啊！
Dialogue: 0,2:27:53.00,2:27:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,蕾普莉！
Dialogue: 0,2:29:06.87,2:29:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,主教！
Dialogue: 0,2:29:55.87,2:29:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱我 - 天呀
Dialogue: 0,2:30:01.75,2:30:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这人类算是不错
Dialogue: 0,2:30:52.05,2:30:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不是要一路睡到家？
Dialogue: 0,2:30:55.14,2:30:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 我能做梦吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:31:00.44,2:31:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，亲爱的，我俩都能做梦
Dialogue: 0,2:31:11.28,2:31:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好好睡 - 我同意
